(30, '2013 VOLKSWAGEN GOLF GTI', '2013-volkswagen-golf-gti', 'Used', 'White', 'grey ', 'Volkswagen', 'Manual', 'Golf', 'Hatchback', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Wolfsburg Edition', '2013 Volkswagen Golf GTI Wolfsburg Edition with 6-speed manual transmission and only 65000KMS. Car is direct Import from Germany with all the options available such as Bluetooth, heated seats, etc. Warranty available which includes 2 years of unlimited KMS with engine and transmission coverage, roadside assistance and $3000 per claim and much more. Financing available for all kinds of credit; good, bad, no credit, not a problem. For more information please contact one of our salesperson:\r\n\r\nAshraf:\r\n\r\nEmail: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPhone: 647-521-7186\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nOmar:\r\n\r\nEmail: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPhone: 647-545-6393', 'sold', 64000, 'km', 13999, '2.0L Turbo', '5', '[\" Active Curise Control\", \" Bluetooth\", \" Bluetooth Audio\", \" Bose Sound\", \" LED Headlight\", \" Multi-Function Steering Wheel\", \" Power Folding Mirror\", \" Power Seats\", \" Sport Seat\", \" Sunroof\", \" traction control\"]', 2013, '[\"/storage/car/29/original/8829.jpg\", \"/storage/car/30/original/8830.jpg\", \"/storage/car/31/original/8831.jpg\", \"/storage/car/32/original/8832.jpg\", \"/storage/car/33/original/8833.jpg\", \"/storage/car/34/original/8834.jpg\", \"/storage/car/35/original/8835.jpg\", \"/storage/car/36/original/8836.jpg\", \"/storage/car/37/original/8837.jpg\", \"/storage/car/38/original/8838.jpg\", \"/storage/car/39/original/8839.jpg\", \"/storage/car/40/original/8840.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2024-01-15 03:02:32', '2024-01-15 03:02:32', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
