(170, '2012 ACURA TL ADVANCED PACKAGE', '2012-acura-tl-advanced-package', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'Acura', 'Automatic', 'TL', 'Sedan', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium Plus', '<p><br></p><p>The 2012 Acura TL Advanced Package is a luxury sedan that combines performance and elegance seamlessly. With a powerful engine, precise handling, and a distinctive design, it offers a dynamic driving experience. The exterior features sleek lines, HID headlights, and alloy wheels for a modern and upscale look.</p><p><br></p><p>Inside, the cabin is a blend of luxury and technology. Premium materials, comfortable leather seats with power adjustments, and dual-zone climate control create a refined atmosphere. The Advanced Package includes advanced tech features like navigation, a premium audio system, and safety features such as a backup camera and blind-spot monitoring.</p><p><br></p><p>Overall, the 2012 Acura TL Advanced Package caters to those who appreciate a stylish and comfortable ride, enhanced by a range of high-end features that elevate the driving experience.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com\n</p>', 'sold', 142500, 'km', 13495, '3.7L', '5', '[\"Active Curise Control\",\"air Cond. Seats\",\"AWD\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Leather seats\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"navigation system\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"parking sensors\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Power Seats\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Sunroof\",\"traction control\",\"Upgraded Soft Leather\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Air Cond. Seats\",\"All Wheel Drive\"