(176, '2015 VOLKSWAGEN JETTA', '2015-volkswagen-jetta', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'Volkswagen', 'Automatic', 'Jetta', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 65, 81);\">2015 Volkswagen Jetta in mint condition. Has options available such as heated seats, Bluetooth, backup camera and much more. Optional two years and unlimited km power terrain warranty. That covers up to $5000 per claim. </span>For any inquiries, please get in touch with one of our Sales-persons:</p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Tel:&nbsp;647-521-7186</p><p>Email:&nbsp;xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Tel:&nbsp;647-545-6393</p><p>Email:&nbsp;xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 132500, 'km', 11995, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\", \"Bluetooth\", \"Sunroof\", \"Bluetooth Audio\", \"Rearview Camera\", \"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\", \"Comfort Seat\", \"Active Curise Control\"]', 2015, '[\"/storage/images/7NsHARBufLkcdeC3HJntueMPJAsFrj37wvN6RfQS.jpg\", \"/storage/images/V7bKZWlWxa1rknZW9VIXsqo87neutu7zRlwibqAs.jpg\", \"/storage/images/JbB0RxgN2sOQ6HgcekACmYkL8ubkcZaJc5DH0mnL.jpg\", \"/storage/images/aRn81IgdscJbeGQcwoZ9rSNjvkLr6B2WTpA8aW5D.jpg\", \"/storage/images/EKTz9n5Cls33D7bZszDIXkk5qhOl7jp8nY4O2NSR.jpg\", \"/storage/images/EE2FXGyIGQiaL0CJmiygc9HvYdADoMgQrRLRm38n.jpg\", \"/storage/images/aO6vKiqxjFr1l6S9EpekVQqmcY4gOY4kgfYfHcQB.jpg\", \"/storage/images/AG62yMST1g1q7UehqILnlddp0FF5tyy6saikaLGs.jpg\", \"/storage/images/7rKDGNCaal2iU7e6QMRBOn3bbYwbpbvaQZfDrz5V.jpg\", \"/storage/images/XOAzqWwxoAs5t3XdHGacSkQXkhx0N8TmIYTd28Sy.jpg\", \"/storage/images/fcaZjtDjgt54geXP0ZVwC0xrHQBX7AGCuZbnNdQC.jpg\", \"/storage/images/OmZm0QlqJAhfXsXbiLaavGZTKYhcj8D9KtSOvGzR.jpg\", \"/storage/images/iChmFtnWnBvqYzlh7UycNSwQQiImya3QJT3nFZqH.jpg\"]', 1, 0, 1, NULL, '2024-01-22 21:58:23', '2024-02-12 03:01:15', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(177, '2023 TOYOTA RAV4 XLE HYBRID', '2023-toyota-rav4-xle-hybrid', 'New', 'Red', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'RAV4', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'Hybrid', 'XLE', '<p>The 2023 Toyota RAV4 XLE Hybrid is a versatile and fuel-efficient SUV that seamlessly combines practicality with eco-friendly performance. This hybrid variant of the popular RAV4 model is equipped with a robust hybrid powertrain, featuring a 2.5-liter four-cylinder engine paired with an electric motor. Together, they deliver a commendable balance of power and efficiency, providing a smooth driving experience both in urban settings and on highways.</p><p><br></p><p>With the RAV4 XLE Hybrid, drivers benefit from Toyota\'s advanced hybrid technology, optimizing fuel efficiency without compromising performance. The hybrid system is complemented by an electronic continuously variable transmission (e-CVT), ensuring seamless transitions between power sources for optimal efficiency.</p><p><br></p><p>The XLE Hybrid trim offers a well-appointed interior with comfortable seating, user-friendly technology, and ample cargo space. Standard features include a touchscreen infotainment system with smartphone integration, keyless entry, and a suite of advanced safety features such as Toyota Safety Sense P (TSS-P), which includes pre-collision systems, lane departure alert, adaptive cruise control, and more.</p><p><br></p><p>The 2023 RAV4 XLE Hybrid also stands out for its contemporary design, featuring sleek lines, a bold front grille, and modern styling elements. The hybrid model benefits from exclusive badging, showcasing its eco-friendly credentials.</p><p><br></p><p>In summary, the 2023 Toyota RAV4 XLE Hybrid offers a compelling package for those seeking a fuel-efficient and environmentally conscious SUV. With its hybrid powertrain, advanced safety features, and practical design, the RAV4 XLE Hybrid continues to be a strong contender in the competitive compact SUV market.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our