(183, '2013 MAZDA 3', '2013-mazda-3', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'Mazda', 'Automatic', 'MAZDA3', 'Hatchback', 'FWD', '4', 'Diesel', 'BASE', '<p>The 2013 Mazda3 Hatchback is a dynamic and stylish compact car that seamlessly blends performance and practicality. Beneath its sleek exterior lies a spirited 2.0-liter four-cylinder engine, delivering 155 horsepower and 148 lb-ft of torque. Paired with a responsive 6-speed automatic, the Mazda3 Hatchback provides an engaging driving experience. With its versatile hatchback design, modern features, and fuel-efficient engine, the 2013 Mazda3 Hatchback stands out as an excellent choice for drivers seeking a combination of style, efficiency, and driving pleasure in a compact package.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 76000, 'km', 8995, '2.0L', '5', '[\"Traction control\", \"Bluetooth Audio\", \"Bluetooth\", \"Comfort Seat\"]', 2013, '[\"/storage/images/z55cfRcNWq6JWESIpZxFydTBZh1YCTw8zHOE3SXb.jpg\", \"/storage/images/tkAYAut9Od3cxwxrDU71hC1hjKXbqMHWMva2zuXk.jpg\", \"/storage/images/F6OT17V32c1tE4oboehesQZh5iCwvziU0tQi26VM.jpg\", \"/storage/images/C3NEmbBDo8Vm6RWOgBoK2TT1souIXtyxPMkTzMZU.jpg\", \"/storage/images/WCo9pWeh6COPRfM7dRZ4KmmdtuUp48jZR5BiARaJ.jpg\", \"/storage/images/EmilGMiYf1ykBL6bnhr2hy9PCVwxiQ6O34m2cuBL.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2024-01-24 01:51:16', '2024-02-17 04:51:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(184, '2010 HONDA PILOT TOURING', '2010-honda-pilot-touring', 'Used', 'Red', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'PILOT', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'TOURING', '<p>The 2010 Honda Pilot Touring is a well-rounded midsize SUV, featuring a robust 3.5-liter V6 engine with 250 horsepower. With a smooth 5-speed automatic transmission, it offers a comfortable and capable driving experience. The Touring trim adds premium features like navigation, rear-seat entertainment, and a power tailgate, making it an excellent choice for families seeking versatility and advanced amenities.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 152590, 'mi', 7500, '3.5L', '7', '[\"Traction control\", \"Navigation system\", \"Bluetooth\", \"Leather seats\", \"Fully Loaded\", \"Power Seats\", \"Sunroof\", \"LED Headlight\", \"Bluetooth Audio\", \"All Wheel Drive\", \"Rearview Camera\", \"7 Seats\", \"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\", \"Towing Package\", \"Power Seat with Memories\", \"Power Tailgate\", \"Bose Sound\", \"Active Curise Control\"]', 2010, '[\"/storage/images/07ZKAbCzeNeCixSEgazERZlzAxHbHpfopxN2VwsG.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Iz22746CHXVPuWT0MaX3KBufi9ahjT6hviVL1eQO.jpg\", \"/storage/images/ma7hxQu4OgwG3QOv6aEHSeCFPXdDWVAEfv2GPYe4.jpg\", \"/storage/images/ZZ5FAgzQUnxwVDTqqH25vfDwuWMJn0Dp5xD4PXUw.jpg\", \"/storage/images/sWg7csltP2yjWUTUJvflAFE123Hfd45mf2rpZLN1.jpg\", \"/storage/images/bnrBmic1hRXDNvpZMPvkZhFuuyINBw77WNun0FuK.jpg\", \"/storage/images/HDpmPtuQbGssaKhcg19hGBy1YT1FhocKdcDTOPZn.jpg\", \"/storage/images/1yrfypu2UwZxHixM9qrnhaigRCvZX9JmORKMSDKJ.jpg\", \"/storage/images/ZeDt8lfQVNRqy8fFq1vg85RXj8xcpPvv4tyHU5my.jpg\", \"/storage/images/xPFa3YcmM65Ev8UU7wQHXWHQWQIgpZugajx