(185, '2017 MAZDA 3 TOURING', '2017-mazda-3-touring', 'Used', 'Red', 'Black', 'Mazda', 'Automatic', 'MAZDA3', 'Hatchback', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'TOURING', '<p>The 2017 Mazda3 Touring Hatchback is a sporty and versatile compact car that delivers both style and performance. Under the hood, it features a peppy 2.0-liter SKYACTIV-G four-cylinder engine, producing 155 horsepower and 150 lb-ft of torque. Paired with a responsive 6-speed automatic transmission, the Mazda3 Touring offers an engaging driving experience with excellent fuel efficiency. With its sleek hatchback design, well-appointed interior, and advanced technology features, the 2017 Mazda3 Touring is a compelling choice for those seeking a dynamic and practical compact car.</p>', 'sold', 65061, 'km', 14500, '2.0L', '5', '[\"Traction control\", \"Navigation system\", \"Bluetooth\", \"Keyless Entry\", \"Power Seats\", \"Sunroof\", \"Bluetooth Audio\", \"Rearview Camera\", \"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\", \"Comfort Seat\", \"Blind Spot Assist\", \"Bose Sound\", \"Active Curise Control\"]', 2017, '[\"/storage/images/Ymvtk3uR1kb3Bnyi6t3XKiA7gB6mwBkId1BQdgaS.jpg\", \"/storage/images/cxiNwRXwZBsRzgExaJVFFFYLgKleMuPzGf1M8bRy.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Zbimx3VcFbwRm1SKgni2AW9UxWrQzU6JSFhjqfTI.jpg\", \"/storage/images/3a3KA6YUkNKgV51SRnlwMOauEgUEyAMxBlLPVXna.jpg\", \"/storage/images/GJ8HTDqLMwyEnzbZF8gRQB7ngxISP2T6yT4m2JJD.jpg\", \"/storage/images/7A6zhSwI8boUQoBmnOP4qLon0DptqaKPs70Y97of.jpg\", \"/storage/images/owMYC3JieIdKAXKNtiS6UhbU435CHZbEFJJAV0kD.jpg\", \"/storage/images/cj2afviFHlOZmKFWo6W50hkkUBTR1mGutNYpdjlJ.jpg\", \"/storage/images/8GCKNzHPJI3I3ebCaFqDly3HVbcelJPVSC9CBcvN.jpg\", \"/storage/images/EbEjRrmKPvNv6nROeGO9o3FnHjk3D8raRrHFqIkQ.jpg\", \"/storage/images/0NQHfSUiIFjrFw9LZ0vrWD6PuwAL7KZvvi6xBeBd.jpg\", \"/storage/images/CRJnxTkI3qFtfQg7G6POjyVjkz7bxLK2XKnPKO36.jpg\", \"/storage/images/gcUBJ6Wbgj9dgEgL0OOiyJNnPpraCykeK87eOodR.jpg\", \"/storage/images/lR1GKdHlzNKFJC9KGjW2JxgS1ebpw7wYRz6CJ1UD.jpg\", \"/stor