(191, '2010 TOYOTA MATRIX', '2010-toyota-matrix', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'MATRIX', 'Hatchback', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p>The 2010 Toyota Matrix is a practical and versatile compact hatchback that excels in efficiency and functionality. Powered by a reliable 1.8-liter four-cylinder engine, it provides a balance of performance and fuel economy. With its user-friendly interior, flexible cargo space, and comfortable seating for five, the Matrix is well-suited for daily commuting and small-family needs. The exterior design is contemporary and functional, and standard features include air conditioning, a CD player, Aux, and cruise control. Overall, the 2010 Toyota Matrix stands as a dependable and efficient choice in the compact hatchback segment.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 168928, 'km', 8786, '1.8L', '5', '[\"Traction control\", \"Active Curise Control\"]', 2010, '[\"/storage/images/IzU8kmZ9ntdeGYLLdgqcB6UOEwhLNXotOgusN9Jz.jpg\", \"/storage/images/SyYuMXpyITj8QuN6sjZ3RdV4x8sz8YtOVmDK5j7A.jpg\", \"/storage/images/5jBm984BTwPYuFiIv7zcPLECERn4uRahQr0l8WV9.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Lv7Ba87zevEOpo3KPYIN9fixjP9UR6uy1DId0nBy.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Sp0PtWYtgWsVvJLUtzcNHSmXnpjq8HfPWWfyJqWd.jpg\", \"/storage/images/7NQIn3FuLx8GxSw3PrRhSFgV4BBeEcjMSNpHlwqx.jpg\", \"/storage/images/BCDU55fPM5JHHP7qOolVmKKXgP0mzn0uYddRJK0j.jpg\", \"/storage/images/H9igDtbEZ9FU7g040OQ8WFEZgiV6Lr640JeHIhe2.jpg\", \"/storage/images/IYdhoqz7NmzTrB37H5SvnOmh0PLUgHaECOifOdZ7.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Upi9kmUZlwHgu8uv9GP12121LShv5WNVb6qQU92m.jpg\", \"/storage/images/qaqaakIRAiSsAIDF9LjZ3t6fv9ShgFJehMoKis33.jpg\", \"/storage/images/dhuG390pBQ