(195, '2008 LEXUS IS250', '2008-lexus-is250-1', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Lexus', 'Automatic', 'Is250', 'Sedan', 'RWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>The 2008 Lexus IS 250 is a luxurious and performance-oriented compact sedan that continues to captivate enthusiasts with its refined design and engaging driving dynamics. Powering this elegant sedan is a responsive 2.5-liter V6 engine, delivering 204 horsepower and 185 lb-ft of torque. Mated to a smooth 6-speed automatic transmission, the IS 250 offers a sophisticated and dynamic driving experience.</p><p><br></p><p>Inside the cabin, the IS 250 showcases a meticulously crafted interior with high-quality materials and attention to detail. The standard features include leather upholstery, dual-zone automatic climate control, and a premium audio system. Advanced safety features, such as stability control and multiple airbags, contribute to the IS 250\'s reputation for providing a secure driving environment.</p><p><br></p><p>The exterior design features sleek lines, a distinctive grille, and alloy wheels, embodying Lexus\' commitment to blending performance with luxury. With its combination of powerful performance, luxurious amenities, and elegant design, the 2008 Lexus IS 250 remains an enticing choice for those seeking a premium compact sedan experience.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 163500, 'km', 9999, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Leather seats\",\"Power Seats\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rea