(197, '2022 TOYOTA 4RUNNER SR5 PREMIUM', '2022-toyota-4runner-sr5-premium', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', '4RUNNER', 'Suv', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>The 2022 Toyota 4Runner SR5 Premium blends rugged capability with refined comfort. Powered by a 4.0-liter V6 engine and 5-speed automatic transmission, it delivers 270 horsepower and 278 lb-ft of torque, with a capable four-wheel-drive system for various terrains. Inside, enjoy spacious seating for seven in SofTex synthetic leather, heated front seats, and an 8-inch touchscreen infotainment system with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto. Safety features include Toyota Safety Sense P suite. With a towing capacity of 5,000 pounds and ample cargo space, it\'s the perfect companion for adventures on and off the road.</p>', 'sold', 22580, 'km', 49999, '4.0L', '7', '[\"Parking sensors\", \"Traction control\", \"Bluetooth\", \"Keyless Entry\", \"Power Seats\", \"Fully Loaded\", \"Sunroof\", \"LED Headlight\", \"All Wheel Drive\", \"Bluetooth Audio\", \"7 Seats\", \"Rearview Camera\", \"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\", \"Towing Package\", \"Comfort Seat\", \"Lane Keep Assist\", \"Blind Spot Assist\", \"Keyless Go\", \"Active Curise Control\", \"Leather seats\"]', 2022, '[\"/storage/images/KKmPGo79hH8vUgkYwmHdyCCWURSgZ4j5odAXq9ac.jpg\", \"/storage/images/s5Z7ZnxiZLu1VkXUyc2KkZU41nvvcMhQinuuwCPW.jpg\", \"/storage/images/RBpQftpQb0L7lbQzGxtiDLcDVSWZRQj9syyZCs3D.jpg\", \"/storage/images/ixF0LjerEcXWBgmnUKS1H02LlIWEye8DjZIV62T4.jpg\", \"/storage/images/FRQKiMpa20zqeWWNHChoT5PKUMN1GSBhxadbyviO.jpg\", \"/storage/images/UsW51IPBG59E7ZrxEyKguZ0136uM81uEwWYMr4ix.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Axh3ixHZRpZPbIO8KFcLzSMLdJByjUA5vpk4LxHn.jpg\", \"/storage/images/ycknGqoiBWdiC3Q8RHNUvWVR060XT22cVvO8b5Xt.jpg\", \"/storage/images/i3jZJTfvioWGLD7fuVW46oFtv6Gm87RwXbyYK5KJ.jpg\", \"/storage/images/hOMprxwRAytIWvuTfD8ffGxTFDNrL51qYMNkvehd.jpg\", \"/storage/images/Xif20mQ6xcEMCl0sbBfLa5HUjIeWcMHRQEHl5wC6.jpg\", \"/storage/images/poT