(198, '2006 TOYOTA SIENNA LE', '2006-toyota-sienna-le', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Beige', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'SIENNA', 'Minivan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'LE', '<p>The 2006 Toyota Sienna LE is a versatile and family-friendly minivan that excels in comfort, reliability, and functionality. Boasting a sleek exterior design, this Sienna LE offers seating for up to seven passengers across three rows, with ample legroom and headspace for all occupants. Under the hood, it features a robust 3.3-liter V6 engine paired with a smooth-shifting five-speed automatic transmission, delivering 215 horsepower and capable performance for both city driving and highway cruising. Safety is a priority with standard features such as anti-lock brakes, traction control, and a comprehensive airbag system, ensuring peace of mind for drivers and passengers alike. Inside, the Sienna LE impresses with its well-appointed cabin, featuring durable cloth upholstery, a power-adjustable driver\'s seat, and a user-friendly dashboard layout. Creature comforts abound with tri-zone climate control, power windows, and locks. With its reputation for durability and longevity, the 2006 Toyota Sienna LE stands as a top choice for families seeking a dependable and spacious minivan for their everyday needs.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 173850, 'km', 8999, '3.3L', '7', '[\"Traction control\",\"Power Seats\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"7 Seats\",\"Towing Package\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\"]', 2006, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JGyVgxuSzySCo2QH0JCZR69nEIoiNu8EaW8jBL0S.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/BStfhpjRryAeiEAxXDP9rytvwPQSTVy5wrPsvgFs.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/