(200, '2022 NISSAN ALTIMA PLATINUM', '2022-nissan-altima-platinum', 'Used', 'Black', 'Beige', 'Nissan', 'Automatic', 'Altima', 'Sedan', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'PLATINUM', '<p>The 2022 Nissan Altima Platinum is a premium midsize sedan that combines style, performance, and advanced features. Under the hood, it offers a potent 2.0-liter turbocharged inline-four delivering 248 horsepower, paired with a responsive continuously variable transmission (CVT). The Altima Platinum features a sleek and modern exterior design with distinctive LED headlights and a bold front grille. Inside, the cabin is spacious and luxurious, with premium materials and amenities such as leather upholstery, heated and ventilated front seats, and a dual-zone automatic climate control system. Advanced technology abounds, with features like a large touchscreen infotainment system with smartphone integration, a premium Bose sound system, and Nissan\'s ProPILOT Assist driver assistance suite, which includes features like adaptive cruise control and lane-keeping assist. With its combination of performance, comfort, and cutting-edge technology, the 2022 Nissan Altima Platinum offers a refined driving experience for discerning buyers in the midsize sedan segment.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 15424, 'km', 20995, '2.0L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Air Cond. Seats\",\"19\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Surroundview Camera\",\"Upgraded Soft Leather\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Power Folding Mirror\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Head-Up Display\"]', 2022, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hUubVieB7uVosekT0TKlL1RQO0kZMBrfKG45mxG9.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/g7VhVYlVXio2qfE9GvyGREwynZH7rN8kfnH7C2kH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RhzzEvdEDgAbQ5tuxRPWu3x56ASlB0BqSujz5ND2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mmBgWoF1btYphRXGvTKvdYeQ69Tcyj4pgfMY339t.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZexQNTly4XYDlSlF5CQ9me2LvpiuZMzkAXpA66BQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AxOLMjf4LREqpC2Et1WIUjy8xs0TTTABRIeMO1Bx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/e1JCa5iHenhocJRLHM70oQUvOPZUQDfxoqro7zKd.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hIfmehyVwl0OG7GUYQkC7bUkuGA7xpqDr0fysym8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fufER67GFkrvTwOGT9pxacezFs16Bfk349pX3EIR.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EPMfTnRhukNbxlU7o42HUhu4VPZuYFFxVJLumG0I.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/yjA1KXXwRKxhrHhn85Ha2efHelFjb4VxiODPlqnk.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/56WLVPz0QNceTJuIIDcwJBb37gcrnqzeWUAJn4qX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ckm7sDVUJjwGkiENwgg8qitC3wHtU9sujRTTgll8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qpPGCia9I65v6R2OIQTgng6fYSbahvg9xUEM5R1D.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2024-02-27 06:03:57', '2024-02-27 06:06:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(201, '2017 HONDA ACCORD EX-L', '2017-honda-accord-ex-l', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Accord', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'EX-L', '<p>The 2017 Honda Accord EX-L is a stylish and well-rounded midsize sedan that offers a blend of performance, comfort, and advanced technology. Under the hood, it features a 2.4-liter inline-4 engine that delivers 185 horsepower and 181 lb-ft of torque, paired with a continuously variable transmission (CVT) for smooth and efficient power delivery. The EX-L trim emphasizes a premium driving experience with a host of luxurious features.</p><p><br></p><p>Inside, the Accord EX-L boasts leather-trimmed seats with heating for both front seats, providing enhanced comfort during colder months. The driver\'s seat includes 10-way power adjustment with memory settings, ensuring personalized comfort. The cabin is designed with high-quality materials and an intuitive layout, making it a pleasant space for both drivers and passengers.</p><p><br></p><p>The EX-L trim is equipped with advanced technology, including a 7-inch Display Audio touchscreen system that supports Apple CarPlay and Android Auto, allowing seamless smartphone integration for navigation, music, and communication. Additionally, the premium audio system delivers clear and powerful sound, enhancing the in-car entertainment experience. Safety features are also a highlight, with the Honda Sensing suite of driver-assist technologies that includes adaptive cruise control, lane keeping assist, and collision mitigation braking, contributing to a secure driving environment.</p><p><br></p><p>On the exterior, the 2017 Honda Accord EX-L presents a sophisticated look with its sleek lines, chrome accents, and LED daytime running lights. The 17-inch alloy wheels add to its refined appearance, while also providing a comfortable ride. Overall, the 2017 Honda Accord EX-L stands out as a reliable and luxurious choice in the midsize sedan segment, offering a harmonious balance of performance, comfort, and advanced features.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquires, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 85000, 'km', 19995, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Sunroof\",\"Bose Sound\",\"LED Headlight\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/rYPBDQEfvsjUPff8hjPGOViSJNXdOeKghEDu3ez2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/of0E1ereS4XPiCndJCkwpBg7OZS3MSobB0QdcsIY.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1rGOJAEeCoz3zOpiziaJgLopktKOLmkJnK003Fas.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/m9t4TmYuJNj1noZyI8E0IQjgDcVrnjgoui96U3qj.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5L5ZyyYL7CoMSVu6MLptEjww02ThZ6PxT6QoSNFF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wbY4rzl9IYVDgY1Q0xyxPDiVN7KZQ0JcNL3wV1RU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ixVNP9ZzTLzpO6MQFKP6Gf0VXf4a2AyqYsPm6nBN.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/PZtpPuRL2r5TYIWXy8iPmkBV59h4kpgmHAMUbaax.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Nc8NJQDQzGfq6Dd6UDm7JDH9BI0Gj8lm2EaRSHdF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/6SAcFdKqFwKyqzYoMG6C0gPtalkvOYAM06jeiME2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dnx0jl9vGjgHgOGlbV3hfZ7u3ScKsdzuu9SXdZ6c.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Y6rBirXopvMaFECEVlra5WhFurNM48ZnpJHTcwOx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/u4LRAKQrNWH09HgSxzlEPdB0js4MI13fhums6WEB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/p1XUn71cRgAEIl9adik1YVNHfDAPuek5GfEVWCvh.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/KgH3bWZVIRYCO8LKauTWVyKeW9EdONtSKobut9bw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/gukwApdbhH3WaXo2Yx3MO0lgcvHG9VADxxoh9P80.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4ZoAtaMrvT