(202, '2010 TOYOTA COROLLA XRS', '2010-toyota-corolla-xrs', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'Corolla', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'XRS', '<p>The 2010 Toyota Corolla XRS is a sporty variant of the popular compact sedan, boasting enhanced performance and sleek design elements. Under the hood, it features a potent 2.4-liter four-cylinder engine producing 158 horsepower and 162 lb-ft of torque, paired with a five-speed  automatic transmission. Its sport-tuned suspension and larger 17-inch alloy wheels provide nimble handling and a spirited driving experience, while the XRS-specific exterior enhancements, including a sportier front fascia, rear spoiler, and chrome exhaust tip, lend it a distinctive aesthetic appeal. Inside, the Corolla XRS offers a comfortable and well-appointed cabin with supportive sport seats, a leather-wrapped steering wheel, and a host of standard features such as power accessories, air conditioning, and a six-speaker sound system with auxiliary input. Safety is paramount with standard antilock brakes, stability control, traction control, and a suite of airbags, making the 2010 Corolla XRS an attractive option for those seeking both performance and practicality in a compact sedan.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 187500, 'km', 8999, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Sunroof\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2010, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dnu5fOOROW1PcbMZFdCgQ61nNr7SdrkLcuJcGnUB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YTS8r2myTQzmADGYQJ4ROjXC6p2GXjfECw7RHuNK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dDv1OJVRi1VFPJc8FP9JANN7Ym7ryi0GBluP4MRB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8WyWvTwMWPepaLAKZzPWijRgjUa2R5K6IDzKH8DC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3fsWbAsz9w4fCeWislYcJASZ7Ye5rQ95DLTRS5GK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Qd2yaCupYS8PBoxga8kET0knbY4OYO4qnoPtWolZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/v3DrvJfxwb8Qw5MiPk3ZkumaMoT4kpx8RgzzIx75.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wYftfdG1hI4oBD7CINiIoiGtk9eJN8gIl033UaUV.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/sM2MAaW8MD1O9gO2G7XKrfpE6nwMJPMQPWgVZKPo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/utfG1GOJ4crDntHeYXieH59lEcPQjzqVp6r43WlB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Gm8pXH4fHOPVD23x7wWibaqcYBDIGzWjphuugqUw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/371s0YfHlHLejrXeFqONwz0rsFa8od3DPfdAvk1A.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YdU3u9xJc0H0KgKmzwZF7ygZKPvZBVpgm9bcdgsC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1FBsECBVRo1DC5fRfMhyBHAuZHao1cN9J7t7PhFv.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2024-03-01 02:29:55', '2024-03-17 03:57:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(203, '2018 VOLKSWAGEN E-GOLF SEL PREMIUM', '2018-volkswagen-e-golf-sel-premium', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Volkswagen', 'Automatic', 'Golf', 'Hatchback', 'FWD', '4', 'Electric', 'Premium', '<p>The 2018 Volkswagen e-Golf SEL Premium, tailored for Canadian roads, exemplifies eco-conscious luxury with its advanced electric drivetrain and premium features. Propelled by an electric motor, this model delivers instant torque and operates seamlessly, powered by a 35.8 kWh battery offering an estimated range of approximately 200 kilometers on a single charge. Equipped with DC fast charging capability, the battery can reach 80% capacity in about 30 minutes, ensuring convenience for urban commutes or longer trips. The SEL Premium trim elevates the driving experience with luxurious touches like leather upholstery, a sunroof, and an intuitive 8-inch touchscreen infotainment system with navigation. Safety is paramount, with standard features such as forward collision warning, automatic emergency braking, and blind-spot monitoring. Combining eco-friendly engineering with upscale amenities, the 2018 e-Golf SEL Premium is a compelling choice for environmentally conscious drivers seeking comfort and advanced technology on Canadian roads.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 97000, 'km', 17786, '0', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise C