(204, '2019 MAZDA 3 SPORT', '2019-mazda-3-sport', 'Used', 'Dark Blue', 'Black', 'Mazda', 'Automatic', 'MAZDA3', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'SPORT', '<p>The 2019 Mazda 3 Sport epitomizes a harmonious blend of dynamic performance, sleek design, and advanced technology, making it a standout choice in the compact car segment. With its Skyactiv-G 2.5-liter four-cylinder engine producing 186 horsepower and 186 lb-ft of torque, paired with a smooth-shifting six-speed automatic transmission, the Mazda 3 Sport delivers exhilarating performance while maintaining impressive fuel efficiency. Its agile handling and responsive steering ensure an engaging driving experience, complemented by a refined cabin featuring premium materials and intuitive controls. The Mazda 3 Sport is equipped with a suite of advanced safety features, including automatic emergency braking, adaptive cruise control, and lane-keeping assist, providing peace of mind on every journey. With its striking design, spirited performance, and cutting-edge technology, the 2019 Mazda 3 Sport sets a new standard for compact cars, captivating drivers who seek both style and substance in their daily drive.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 76000, 'km', 18800, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Navigation system\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bose Sound\",\"LED Headlight\",\"LED Headlight\"]', 2019, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/m8o5ZdhlfNqsnppKhlFchaY8S5