(205, '2007 LEXUS IS250', '2007-lexus-is250', 'Used', 'Dark Grey', 'Black', 'Lexus', 'Manual', 'Is250', 'Sedan', 'RWD', '4', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p>The 2007 Lexus IS250 Manual is a sports sedan designed for driving enthusiasts. It features a 2.5-liter V6 engine producing 204 horsepower and 185 lb-ft of torque. Paired with a six-speed manual transmission, it offers a dynamic driving experience with precise control over gear shifts. With its luxurious interior, advanced technology, and sleek design, the IS250 Manual delivers a perfect balance of performance and refinement.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 176000, 'km', 10995, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2007, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8okOhJ774pltmzwqqp1LXqCLhAZACstBghl6lOE6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/KspWwoC1Ozy0ctLWMyicqAboHq6gjmyiQATSsa4W.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vZRuEQPfCGTZ4KGMHVefyTkAUSr6AKgSwD6nZ1SP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/COhigZb7ui6Pb9RATbvyn4jTcAaBmAxbsKdp2peB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/CrCKYM6NPhMrpHDqNBxBoCtdeY886lsgm1pJCrFw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/0anolt9EPTRXmvXfRcKZ2ZXBmFPtMB73J7YWENDU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/BZGG7Sm8MlGM7h20AMwNN1LbirMqNovHBYqXzcPa.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wmywwRZ7hidyjUqxFPLgf8Ch3Btw27cSLy3BdF8a.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1dRo2XjTdCuueEokvhUA1aJAmgxgRCYK4WwbcCIM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/CMfIit9Rhzewyoh73VNl8DEOEBv8h4owdkfbib7z.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WtmzZqur5wfuOkOKLNdK3MyIChsO7t9AkhXoPFDt.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8S2vwjLjpi0uNP4GJeqcpaVIGmFceYH23ff0KA41.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/20Pn7