(206, '2008 TOYOTA HIGHLANDER SR5', '2008-toyota-highlander-sr5', 'Used', 'Red', 'Beige', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'HIGHLANDER', 'Suv', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'SR5', '<p>The 2008 Toyota Highlander SR5 is a versatile midsize SUV renowned for its blend of performance and comfort. Powered by a robust 3.5-liter V6 engine producing 270 horsepower and 248 lb-ft of torque, paired with a smooth 5-speed automatic transmission, it delivers ample power and efficiency for various driving needs. Inside, its spacious cabin accommodates up to seven passengers in premium cloth-upholstered seats, complemented by a host of technological features including a touchscreen infotainment system and Bluetooth connectivity. Safety is prioritized with standard features like antilock brakes and stability control. With its sleek exterior design and array of features, the Highlander SR5 offers a compelling option for families and individuals seeking a reliable and enjoyable SUV experience.</p>', 'sold', 225750, 'km', 8999, '3.5L', '7', '[\"Traction control\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Towing Package\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2008, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/bXBUwchwanUokw38rUcNplWAAgVcmZVzj73KRyVW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fUd7XuMW4WFVt870RDwUeqyzYPLxa7rmuIxyiBAs.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ynHriX2Z345kFHYPZBF2p00RjqZwpyqdTLGT4dx4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lN4dkPOwzJYt6WVe2ZUoeX6xvmOIzcTLu8DknCn9.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AJ07fH5TAJIFclv1JE6de5sreb8zgOSpgoz5Y5Lv.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/6gK5ZzdNlXQhXypWWf8rHlVdK2jNYQ8wH2mZzlp4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/B9XeZn8q7cQLU7UVOX3NBOpiCoZjAyCTdlKbQXf5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5x3j236C654gbXDdZfPL3mivPBaYXazAHpa1ihke.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wWCSBsSEyPPPeJPlWi54L9VtFPWaFDQAMSpYenAA.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qHXZ6McI3dfHr1dRNAAslXqZQoBqiE0gWM0qZVYJ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/OfOduPp35ZfAHF7Kqvjar5tb5jJVCsoQR0Vt0qlZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\