(207, '2022 HONDA CIVIC TOURING', '2022-honda-civic-touring', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Civic', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'TOURING', '<p>Absolutely! Here\'s a condensed version:</p><p><br></p><p>The 2022 Honda Civic Touring is a sleek and sophisticated compact sedan that packs a punch with its 1.5-liter turbocharged inline-4 engine, delivering 180 horsepower and 177 lb-ft of torque. Paired with a smooth CVT, it offers seamless acceleration and exceptional fuel efficiency. Inside, you\'ll find a refined cabin with leather-trimmed seats, dual-zone climate control, and an intuitive touchscreen infotainment system with Apple CarPlay® and Android Auto™ integration. Safety features abound, providing peace of mind on every journey. With its blend of style, performance, and technology, the Civic Touring is the ideal choice for discerning drivers.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 119000, 'km', 26786, '1.5L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Folding Mirror\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Head-Up Display\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2022, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tK99LZ2q3s7KDOIWrRGfKiVdjIv6tCnFl2LE25Wj.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/exgWOALAfeMgz9UlNXiawWHxVYoemIttf1yhaooe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8FiKDV1ZdQ7Tx1p1AtjcHWrZmPkN0iBGFN7fgDP1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZOor1vaOR6hHOQT1fdPs9Am5atXWQmjs