(210, '2019 JEEP CHEROKEE TRAILHAWK', '2019-jeep-cherokee-trailhawk', 'Used', 'Maroon', 'Black', 'Jeep', 'Automatic', 'CHEROKEE TRAILHAWK', 'Suv', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'ELITE', '<p>The 2019 Jeep Cherokee Trailhawk Elite Package is a robust and versatile SUV designed for both rugged off-road adventures and comfortable daily driving. It stands out with its aggressive exterior styling, featuring distinctive red tow hooks, a black hood decal, and a unique front fascia that enhances its bold appearance. Under the hood, it is powered by a 3.2L V6 engine delivering 271 horsepower and 239 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 9-speed automatic transmission and a 4x4 drivetrain equipped with Jeep Active Drive Lock, ensuring exceptional performance on various terrains.</p><p><br></p><p>Inside, the Trailhawk Elite Package offers premium Nappa leather-trimmed seats with heating for both front seats, along with a heated steering wheel and a dual-pane panoramic sunroof, providing a luxurious and comfortable driving experience. The 8.4-inch touchscreen display with the Uconnect 4C NAV system includes Apple CarPlay, Android Auto, and integrated navigation, along with a premium audio system for an enhanced in-car entertainment experience. Advanced safety features such as blind-spot monitoring, rear cross-path detection, adaptive cruise control, and lane departure warning ensure a secure driving experience.</p><p><br></p><p>The Trailhawk variant is Trail Rated, boasting enhanced off-road features like increased ground clearance, skid plates, and the Selec-Terrain traction management system with Rock Mode, making it capable of handling a variety of terrains with ease. Overall, the 2019 Jeep Cherokee Trailhawk Elite Package combines luxury, advanced technology, and exceptional off-road capability, making it an ideal choice for those who demand versatility and performance in their SUV.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><