(211, '2018 MAZDA 3 GX', '2018-mazda-3-gx', 'Used', 'Dark Blue', 'Black', 'Mazda', 'Automatic', 'MAZDA3', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p>The 2018 Mazda 3 GX Automatic is a sleek and dynamic compact car, boasting Mazda\'s distinctive KODO design. Equipped with a 2.0-liter Skyactiv-G engine, it delivers a responsive performance while maintaining excellent fuel efficiency. Paired with a smooth automatic transmission, it offers seamless acceleration and handling. Inside, the cabin is designed for comfort and connectivity, featuring intuitive controls and a user-friendly infotainment system. Safety is paramount with advanced features like Blind Spot Monitoring and Smart City Brake Support. Overall, the Mazda 3 GX Automatic offers a thrilling driving experience with practicality in mind.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 85500, 'km', 14500, '2.0L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Advance Key\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SynSuLGogKN4O0sa6wQVI6OgG4fXWxC12kkvWxAe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/rIarpYauA34XqwMo0YN3gRtCSFK60OQXRz1VOeJq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hRw8q6WU3CXK8aTydNQiFeyziVFU2wnc1SKCTIoe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YGUPZdutyZulxDFygpkKvuXBN7cl876K2GVPPHRb.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/oAGCe7zOFXqxufeo5kcAF22cWmXx9OXtd5KgbLht.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/asuc75pPyKRHxkQa9lUz1WoygHax8lr28VcbLAHR.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dP1BPdmDHLf8wnKtyVRmx4s9T1GLzo08tQ7uvvxx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cGRJHG6OFacUzwGNz90JFSt9BUbZMHKsgCk1O02o.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/eoL