(212, '2016 HONDA ACCORD SPORT', '2016-honda-accord-sport', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Accord', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'SPORT', '<p>Experience the perfect blend of performance and refinement with the 2016 Honda Accord Sport. Under its sleek hood lies a spirited 2.4-liter inline-four engine, delivering a potent 189 horsepower and 182 lb-ft of torque. Paired with a smooth-shifting continuously variable transmission (CVT), the Accord Sport offers the versatility to match your driving style.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks to Honda\'s innovative Earth Dreams™ technology, this engine achieves impressive fuel efficiency without compromising on power. With direct fuel injection and intelligent Variable Valve Timing and Lift Electronic Control (i-VTEC), the Accord Sport delivers exhilarating acceleration while remaining fuel-conscious.</p><p><br></p><p>Beyond its impressive performance, the Accord Sport boasts a refined ride and handling balance. Equipped with a sport-tuned suspension and precise electric power-assisted steering, every twist and turn becomes a joyous affair. Plus, with its athletic exterior styling and upscale interior appointments, the Accord Sport exudes confidence and sophistication on every journey.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether cruising down the highway or navigating city streets, the 2016 Honda Accord Sport redefines what a midsize sedan can be, offering a harmonious fusion of sportiness, efficiency, and comfort.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 185500, 'km', 14995, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"Bluetooth A