(213, '2016 TOYOTA HIGHLANDER XLE', '2016-toyota-highlander-xle', 'Used', 'Dark Blue', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'HIGHLANDER', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'XLE', '<p>The 2016 Toyota Highlander XLE is a mid-size SUV that combines versatility, comfort, and performance. It is powered by a robust 3.5-liter V6 engine, delivering 270 horsepower and 248 lb-ft of torque, paired with a six-speed automatic transmission. This configuration ensures a smooth and responsive driving experience, whether on city streets or highways. The Highlander XLE features a well-designed interior with seating for up to eight passengers, leather-trimmed seats, and a power sunroof. Advanced tech includes a touchscreen infotainment system with navigation, Bluetooth, and a suite of safety features like a rearview camera and blind-spot monitoring.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 121500, 'km', 23786, '3.5L', '8', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Towing Package\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2016, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fD0DPZoDzrPTSmqkORVoahW8nB1hCg3fgOEPtWjC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/P90AeHIaYMH6HmJ6kisJN8uLHgQnEZfL93A70VSg.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/QSrWn5lff9hDmeByphNYVn6j5K29gTOmmpOQld6A.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xDeJtjarIV7jmDN0BqhNUH4kT6c5v64u1qpyBs2Y.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/PjyzKopvqe0Zcz5lstfqH577SGVejrShZNy5EeU8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\