(214, '2018 TOYOTA RAV4 XLE ADVENTURE', '2018-toyota-rav4-xle-adventure', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'RAV4', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'XLE', '<p>The 2018 Toyota RAV4 XLE Adventure is a versatile compact SUV designed to offer both comfort and capability. This model features a robust 2.5-liter four-cylinder engine that produces 176 horsepower, paired with a six-speed automatic transmission. Its all-wheel-drive system enhances traction on various terrains, making it suitable for off-road adventures. The XLE trim level includes a host of amenities such as a sunroof, dual-zone automatic climate control, and a 7-inch touchscreen infotainment system with Bluetooth connectivity. Inside, the RAV4 XLE Adventure offers spacious seating for up to five passengers and ample cargo space, making it a practical choice for families and outdoor enthusiasts alike.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', 'upcoming', 0, 'km', 24995, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Towing Package\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Tailgate\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8GUFovZQDktpJagTlSFkPr6T3KZf8kS7QLXd2qrr.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2024-09-29 00:21:41', '2024-09-13 23:57:51', '2024-09-29 00:21:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(215, '2018 TOYOTA RAV4 XLE ADVENTURE', '2018-toyota-rav4-xle-adventure-1', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'RAV4', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'XLE', '<p>The 2018 Toyota RAV4 XLE Adventure is a versatile compact SUV designed to offer both comfort and capability. This model features a robust 2.5-liter four-cylinder engine that produces 176 horsepower, paired with a six-speed automatic transmission. Its all-wheel-drive system enhances traction on various terrains, making it suitable for off-road adventures. The XLE trim level includes a host of amenities such as a sunroof, dual-zone automatic climate control, and a 7-inch touchscreen infotainment system with Bluetooth connectivity. The Adventure variant also boasts distinctive styling elements like rugged front and rear bumper designs, larger wheels, and roof rails, adding to its rugged appearance. Inside, the RAV4 XLE Adventure offers spacious seating for up to five passengers and ample cargo space, making it a practical choice for families and outdoor enthusiasts alike.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 70660, 'km', 16999, '2.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Towing Package\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Keyless Entry\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/X3f4jB108471p3bmWSlV8dq1zX534oeF9ZaYLJeX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/6OV2CBLfp6RNdtDKusbbtgIonlI52GRNdjeayOjb.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/60jsX6IjqAKizeGgwl7GasVrHIMElIeeIOz9sVbn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images