(217, '2018 AUDI A5 COUPLE PROGRESSIV', '2018-audi-a5-couple-progressiv', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'Audi', 'Automatic', 'A5', 'Coupe', 'AWD', '2', 'GAS', 'Premium Plus', '<p>The 2018 Audi A5 Coupe Progressiv is a sleek, all-wheel-drive luxury coupe featuring a 2.0-liter turbocharged inline-4 engine. It delivers 252 horsepower and 273 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 7-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission, providing a smooth yet powerful ride. The Quattro all-wheel-drive system enhances traction and handling, especially in diverse road conditions. Inside, the Progressiv trim includes leather seating, a sunroof, Audi’s MMI infotainment system with a 7-inch display, smartphone integration, and advanced driver-assist features like parking sensors and blind-spot monitoring. It combines performance with luxury for a balanced driving experience.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 49600, 'km', 26000, '2.0L TURBO', '4', '[\"Traction control\",\"Parking sensors\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Air Cond. Seats\",\"19\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Upgraded Soft Leather\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Head-Up Display\",\"Heated steering\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YmJmZlI4iTEWuLpVJ7PVXxwrhigm8msJmVETc45E.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8WHfJUfvmKpAnQtgGUcpT37YTmRaOhq2RXKbv0Hg.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dzsN1nJchyeVrgk1qNXRrh25PFgcOqa