(219, '2005 BMW Z4', '2005-bmw-z4', 'Used', 'Grey', 'Black', 'BMW', 'Manual', 'M4', 'Convertible', 'RWD', '2', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>The 2005 BMW Z4 3.0L Convertible is a dynamic and stylish open-top roadster, featuring a2.5-liter inline-6 engine with 184 horsepower. This powerful engine, paired with a 5-speed manual transmission, enables quick acceleration and a thrilling, responsive driving experience. With rear-wheel drive, precise steering, and a sport-tuned suspension, it’s well-suited for both city cruising and winding roads. The convertible top can be easily operated, adding to the appeal of open-air driving. Inside, the Z4 offers a premium, driver-focused cabin with high-quality materials and supportive leather seats, combining luxury with performance.</p><p><br></p><p><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿﻿</span>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'available', 163500, 'km', 9999, '2.5L', '2', '[\"Traction control\",\"Xenon\",\"Leather seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Harman Kardon Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bluetooth\"]', 2005, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/uiIa6q98OxZHWvDcQA8UHaOHu1J8bFKugiaBaCUV.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/UXjkodR9325UehuctaTi5mjiMWMgQDE0mRuAAfus.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JEwTvOA1MYH7NVJ5dVFzay14g31mVDP6QwLVRbXh.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WiyLy0EWW7ilvKpVLX58JdMLrhgx0TQCPvMZUXGy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/gD0zNuyQ0gvFDSZOQ625myWy1OqAMNOIJdIn2hg0.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JOhpTysl8zUGuZtblvRfocyzznViPzWSAUqbj3s7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/bfrLmF92Ja9ZmRcyAgaWrSPe6wdjjdTCTK2WPK3c.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/o7EpPaIxENJhFB6JrfcUTfkbNbdevbX2rcBpl93O.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/g5b2H5CytYFNOBB7fGJ