(220, '2019 TOYOTA 4RUNNER SR5', '2019-toyota-4runner-sr5', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', '4RUNNER', 'Suv', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'SR5', '<p>The 2019 Toyota 4Runner SR5 is a rugged midsize SUV designed for both off-road capability and daily driving comfort. This model is powered by a reliable 4.0-liter V6 engine, which delivers 270 horsepower at 5,600 rpm and 278 lb-ft of torque at 4,400 rpm. Paired with a 5-speed automatic transmission, the 4Runner SR5 provides a smooth and responsive driving experience, whether navigating highways or tackling challenging terrains. With a towing capacity of up to 5,000 pounds, the 4Runner SR5 combines power with versatility, making it an ideal choice for outdoor adventures and everyday commutes.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 155000, 'mi', 22800, '4.0L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Power Seats\",\"LED Headlight\",\"20\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Towing Package\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2019, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wE8aybURgSeqUOEEciq3IqtpDWgWiCVtNctQy4vW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Lf0yNyoIAKhT04ImW2nOaERNwKygyL5iihi2eAdx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1O83ccCgKWDqJ3nwDzEmzSMTIW7a7KLmRC321o8Z.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/44UpMCDjJl3zGmg64oVVK838fcOpdUV4sxnT5Yej.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dXUjJ81TT5CH2Gwu0RkxSH4IZn11WJQwgCDRVZzo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/T3W5UZvCRBrN5TheSC9NmlMkWKR5H93UaqSO8fxk.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/K0bRgqgwO8d2JHo5zOefADXPjWasDiQH2Z22rfOn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/F5jUJRxJB40lkMVH1nvm2CU19K5bVQFJHQCxGCaQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Tja