(221, '2016 HYUNDAI SANTAFE XL PREMIUM', '2016-hyundai-santafe-xl-premium', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Grey', 'Hyundai', 'Automatic', 'Santa Fe', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'XL PREMIUM', '<p>The 2016 Hyundai Santa Fe XL Premium is a versatile midsize SUV with seating for seven, making it an ideal choice for families needing extra space and comfort. Under the hood, it features a 3.3-liter V6 engine that generates 290 horsepower at 6,400 rpm and 252 lb-ft of torque at 5,200 rpm. Paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission, this engine provides smooth acceleration and a comfortable drive. The Santa Fe XL Premium also includes advanced safety features, a spacious interior, and ample cargo capacity, making it a practical and well-rounded option for both city driving and longer trips.</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Omar Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-545-6393</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p>', 'sold', 119087, 'km', 13999, '3.3L', '7', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Power Seats\",\"Smart Key\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Heated steering\",\"HEATED SEATS\",\"HILL DESCENT\",\"Bose Sound\",\"7 Seats\",\"Parking sensors\"]', 2016, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WXWsBDHudtTFz2WtDZimyCL3ohcoHpp4rIVjqewD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7eYPWkvAiIzlyQB8RDHLFHGud5IYxlLum8hxwGPb.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vvU5BZJADO2tStPqXFHqvorY0gu7dCRQjKBalkiE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qYf7ApPW9ttnijxlqU5gURLb1VAMmhfzG9bS9JXS.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/uIOiR2bAbl3jp52MCoJlQqI8jdKBi6bmqA8exCZC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Rx5uvsibtqfgxElZOX8yqRdtdux9fdf2L5hMDFOb.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MzLGobOvbvROW3FJTG6TlEmNsruhULh5I