(222, '2015 TOYOTA SIENNA LE', '2015-toyota-sienna-le', 'Used', 'Grey', 'Beige', 'Toyota', 'Automatic', 'SIENNA', 'VAN', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'LE', '<p>The 2015 Toyota Sienna LE 7-Passenger is a spacious and reliable minivan designed with families in mind, offering a comfortable interior with seating for seven and ample cargo space. Under the hood, it features a 3.5-liter V6 engine that produces 266 horsepower at 6,200 rpm and 245 lb-ft of torque at 4,700 rpm, paired with a smooth 6-speed automatic transmission. the Sienna LE provides a comfortable and stable ride, making it ideal for city driving and long-distance family trips. Additionally, it includes convenient features like a rearview camera, tri-zone climate control, and easy-access sliding doors, enhancing comfort and usability for passengers.</p>', 'sold', 128500, 'km', 17999, '3.5L', '7', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Power Seats\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"7 Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\"]', 2015, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/e8rgyyXXkuFXF3mHYMtLf6PHqLWJiVpxStKxLzL0.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/W7TcSnnXy1i7IbWZHiNfmMOyWxffC0EfiPY14NTB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ROCya2WH12udAATWvDLgY8D1VQrtF8NrEp5cHFep.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tiAuJ1juAZl1GV9MWEOaRAgKxHJdy00p2cnLw8Lq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1mZQ4XwL60PEEdvy9uDFiXaJaSZVVJJimS9JEgqp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SCqyz2XBHm1KcknEbfQcenBKhPx9hExOXjJmQgkQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZU9dD13iov0DAJuUq3lIqIam42aou6Z36uT5Klka.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/v0HY3Ube6TYxj0dUUDpLyftOqONcHFEVsWeysTWD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Em0I5qBtE2FyOARix66pdNmy84RgmNhs6ZEqv9WD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/o5lEBucNUQDso1f1p1A2Hsm1gsvbJ4RSBis6JTBK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XMjy63H729ACTNSa2PmsGBUBojF4j88PK3mzyeD3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/CEA9Fq7f9lQV8KdaSy1dHJAlnkWAy7CuxgoC1oKX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4G307Gs8WXsIstuHPTnHlmxIgY8gshw8lExes5cc.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Facm