(223, '2013 HONDA CIVIC SI', '2013-honda-civic-si-1', 'Used', 'Dark Grey', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Manual', 'Civic', 'Coupe', 'FWD', '2', 'GAS', 'SI', '<p>The 2013 Honda Civic Si Coupe is a sporty and fun-to-drive compact car, known for its responsive handling and energetic performance. It is powered by a 2.4-liter inline-4 VTECH engine that produces 201 horsepower at 7,000 rpm and 170 lb-ft of torque at 4,400 rpm. This engine is paired with a 6-speed manual transmission, offering an engaging driving experience for enthusiasts. The Civic Si Coupe features sport-tuned suspension and upgraded styling, making it stand out from the standard Civic lineup. Inside, it includes comfortable seating, a premium audio system, and tech features like a rearview camera and Bluetooth connectivity, blending sportiness with everyday practicality.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>for inquiries, contact one of our sales representatives:</p><p><br></p><p>Ashraf Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-521-7186</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p><p>Emad Alighazi</p><p>Phone: 647-573-2552</p><p>Email: xtremeinc.86@gmail.com</p><p><br></p>', 'available', 96000, 'km', 14000, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2013, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Rx80W9c0Mcyd6OSyspHrofKBl0YrtsbgLQD6uFYY.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YUDQ3ORafQ8CtTXW6fvAVfMrpAyTnYitQ7wJ0Sfc.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/PbkYsE29VDNTXR6WfVIO66C22Npw2tmgalsOI1HC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WzhD7z1ufrX0vtTlp2M36RkLnajjwDcpFpYZ2mIF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Bs7rjQeBUXhi9YXML81pvIr91JycR53yPFYEMhRq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3atOzIg98dhJVE2O3wBKe7RvXxgTAZMJCPhtOm5E.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4rHClrCLmwxFYXwdWFAKFxjazpXK4EyYcI1etHTk.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JZjjqRUbipugT57KxKKqoX3lomOtJsigipM324Zr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/9HySfS5a