(224, '2013 HONDA CIVIC SI', '2013-honda-civic-si-2', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Manual', 'Civic', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'SI', '<p>The 2013 Honda Civic Si 4-Door is a sporty compact sedan that combines performance and practicality. Equipped with a 2.4-liter inline-4 engine, it delivers 201 horsepower at 7,000 rpm and 170 lb-ft of torque at 4,400 rpm. The engine features Honda\'s i-VTEC (Intelligent Variable Valve Timing and Lift Electronic Control) technology, optimizing power delivery and efficiency. Paired with a 6-speed manual transmission, it offers a responsive driving experience with a precise gear shift. The Civic Si includes a sport-tuned suspension, enhancing handling, while its front-wheel-drive layout provides stable traction. </p>', 'sold', 185000, 'km', 9999, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Sunroof\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2013, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/n8t6u20kcRPd4FBdWB02YCWGYcNpcrrNsiWMKFOW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZKbRflAEj9eEAF0238C7xE5hvAAAllhUSNrIqyr6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Fx8fbanZi5tUNo6UkW1nLoAgckVuLmDSsbLLickh.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RbciXDplNnqDbjr5TWc677vute5dhFXX7cYffW00.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/B5g7RbVF316Uo2q81FX7n1beEeEdsVxVFEW7Hjzl.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lBDBG7xpQPtYxdOM73Z5bajfHfMYXGjw14vjLgHe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tRCyJOJRDxzkll8gmRXAFgDT8ULP2T13MQ81WiLN.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/OaTnUB0ph8H0IWoxPj3PwgMHc7QgKppvYEkjj2C4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/psHW0NVQj7mFWDbR3aDKCQXd4WCre1c49lZUEkPh.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/m57i7AuEhvmtDNxAzSUX5OlCwSiUZf7XhqCufSsI.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/iTwRmtV5DxOIWrhtJm65mz4KA95Gf5dV9AamNv0e.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/LLIdTg9id9OCe58ZORWV8fGVwgVQpw62ywVC9XdM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/s0e3BSP7JhFuAP2NdYhhlHr1QTML8sO9PJrfTyiD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/OVh5NLgRYN0ll3oUs0ruFPVu0OY