(225, '2024 HONDA CR-V TOURING HYBRID', '2024-honda-cr-v-touring-hybrid', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'CRV', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'Hybrid', 'TOURING', '<p>The 2024 Honda CR-V Touring Hybrid is a top-tier, efficient, and versatile compact SUV that combines modern design with eco-friendly performance. Powered by a 2.0-liter Atkinson-cycle four-cylinder engine paired with an electric motor, the hybrid system delivers a combined 204 horsepower and exceptional fuel efficiency. The Touring Hybrid model features Honda’s Real Time AWD, which enhances handling and traction across various road conditions.</p><p><br></p><p>Inside, the CR-V Touring Hybrid offers a spacious, high-quality cabin with seating for up to five, premium leather upholstery, and a sunroof. The 9-inch touchscreen display integrates seamlessly with Android Auto and wireless Apple CarPlay, while the 12-speaker Bose premium audio system provides an immersive sound experience. Standard Honda Sensing® safety features include adaptive cruise control, lane-keeping assist, and a multi-angle rearview camera, making the CR-V Touring Hybrid a top choice for drivers who value comfort, style, and eco-conscious technology.</p>', 'sold', 33700, 'km', 44999, '2.0L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Folding Mirror\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Heated steering\",\"Remote start\",\"HILL DESCENT\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2024, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/BhMD4mNosbbDILUnt55L0ropEdEN6WYzyZ8GW1iS.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EUjQ4h13glsEOJO5WNuVyxflyQSRLl4s3v9dsrBM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FzU4a5NaVAGWYRDZ8njteAc9NsWhQiulxrROUG5h.jpg\",\"\\/st