(226, '2012 KIA SPORTAGE LX', '2012-kia-sportage-lx', 'Used', 'Red', 'Black', 'Kia', 'Automatic', 'Sportage', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'LX', '<p>The 2012 Kia Sportage LX AWD is a compact SUV featuring a 2.4-liter inline-4 engine. This engine produces 176 horsepower at 6,000 RPM and 168 lb-ft of torque at 4,000 RPM, delivering a balance of power and fuel efficiency. Paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission, the all-wheel-drive system enhances traction, making it suitable for various driving conditions, including light off-road adventures.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The Sportage LX AWD\'s fuel economy is rated at around 11.8L in the city and 8.7L on the highway. The engine uses a DOHC (Double Overhead Camshaft) configuration with 16 valves and is equipped with CVVT (Continuously Variable Valve Timing), which helps optimize fuel efficiency and performance. This model also includes features like a comfortable interior, ample cargo space, and a smooth, responsive ride that appeals to families and commuters alike.</p>', 'sold', 130000, 'km', 9999, '2.4L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Towing Package\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Heated steering\",\"HILL DESCENT\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2012, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/CPCGMvf2sV2K4NMOj3UYob4JQ9rwQ6LUJWonRyNz.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/M0TZfTWH46YSsOUYwsQu6yozsGLNkSjI96059FCF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qiJQcJ9bTEsrmONzF3Tlq3WUtPK7AzAmX0SmBz5Q.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/pDqYLPiAAiKeWtYuY6hkqG7suPy8Zd7c6MKQvDzq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/w52alxgjs0wLSYCyqHWJPOBnO3ppwrFUBgNnVOMn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/iNMveKlQYbFs9xJRM60FPRKHC6pb3NOfoOICgaHx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/89RHGotOAqgkcJ7j9p4L0IBiUvTmayqMxmFRRt1K.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WjhY8AWtdpvj1UUy6phlt3RvA7xBQOrKw0H3stgy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/yxVgh9e2g7ABQsbJ39GPIRv1szxl1LDOksN9z4bp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/OTlVW4dqo3PELR6X8X8TlTNBvZdDSYAzC6XnyfPT.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZnCtlWENDUhSWTNG6Oqo8AQpoPD42XieJ5V0YBas.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/eeNotMQqP3IobHsCiYS2otdWN0HuWnfYERfWQunS.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/S7ZDVR7mgXQqLc2h13QwmP9ia0AZq24KPJW8r3BZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DuzAv7dI7mXgI7FzdApSOtqo9ioHQQpuGeFXQiuc.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/0Jy2Qq9SW0Hv81Y9yTOMNZxgJPrRoiFPqZCFlCt5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3lITcncYAdXAO1AIXDVJsMlCnjQNuIB2d4mWZDff.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xgoUe1zigNp6xbdqR82mXKPmQRl35DyzIj6KLSg4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/o4pbna7Svcero9yfuApagDsyAZ1cSNqDd5OgjxUe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/U69siSJPgFZgDHp2uXmhseeLGturwQGAkYWZtyZJ.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:10:01', '2024-11-14 01:57:26', '2025-08-26 22:10:01', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=cQlykNn6Nqku9OkzowddL0iuYB7akxpZ', 'KNDPBCA28C7283429', '11.8L', '8.7L'),
(227, '2015 JEEP GRAND CHEROKEE LIMITED', '2015-jeep-grand-cherokee-limited', 'Used', 'White', 'Beige', 'Jeep', '8 Speed Automatic', 'Grand Cherokee', 'Suv', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'LIMITED', '<p>The 2015 Jeep Grand Cherokee Limited with a 5.7L HEMI V8 engine is a premium midsize SUV that combines luxury, capability, and powerful performance. The HEMI engine delivers 360 horsepower and 390 lb-ft of torque, paired with an 8-speed automatic transmission for smooth power delivery and towing capability up to 7,200 lbs. Jeep’s Quadra-Trac II 4WD system ensures excellent off-road and all-weather performance, complemented by the Selec-Terrain system for various driving conditions.</p><p>Fuel consumption for the HEMI-equipped Grand Cherokee averages approximately 15.7 L/100 km in the city and 10.7 L/100 km on the highway. Inside, the Limited trim offers premium leather seats, heated front and rear seats, a heated steering wheel, an 8.4-inch Uconnect infotainment system with navigation, and a power liftgate. With seating for five and a cargo space of up to 1,945 liters (with rear seats folded), it balances utility and refinement. Standard safety features include blind-spot monitoring, rear cross-traffic alert, and a rearview camera.</p>', 'available', 87500, 'km', 19999, '5.7L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Parking sensors\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Towing Package\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Heated steering\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2015, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SS91uMD2emC24tU2AvQ9OlcIvYXLQh7r3TlJT0mw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fFI4Wv0vammLkBe6NdxuBHa6DFYPw5XOF5uSvjya.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RU9tKnrNIyfOy4bT1aUAoHXBaF3crrpT5uxrpB89.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/D2BvPwxOm50XFluwlVSv49Hj0XvLdGuwnaOGmlbZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tW28q3qYFjPtPAjcacywuvP7DG2W39LJWgEgocle.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Z1ayM6IjfexRWAKpJS5mKvTMalillAlbjkv2Bqoq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/GedPqppZK98KnqOEigIJSkgRAq4Zlcj78q6nb0RR.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JKuHNfjQyCf5vv1jFlcEP1GAdIYsIuHPJQOFQMh2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/9vdxIAGFD9xRCJCxH78Yuqq501bwErWGOt3uQf0v.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3wASP38M5kctjV8cAJI92VwjexFrjR6gudeqvNqp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/UH369IdQZ92VFzX0VbNrq4GndZs2w8CsmqcU9eES.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/nrcBzAG2XwN0EDpQN4LHLSR44wM0xZR1kyKHTNib.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/t5eq2sC8ItWh88MWZyEQGwvhLrAok6Fo66fFsZoo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5gdUQL3OXZFg4GgsiAjU705dr6GSVa52jBETzFwr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hOM76Z7tMcMVZrLyDAvNsWk9C0DiclVTy91VrlEG.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MWBnQl74ZXpT8j63a7MRO6Tj8FvAbk5oTozsstrH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AbURQZCpmEYb2BzkdBiEsASAtFr9dBUIWWcng7RZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ORjA0LVaix7uXUK28oeAcT87oqUyohFO9KUfpo5G.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vN5uFexAC8cjBrMeSt1YBEunj7l7umhAlxm9Y9ps.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/wLdUJvNzcBlTuhC4cin6ZFEfGIlrR2tbnlsIqXXP.jpg\"]', 0, 1, 1, '2025-01-10 04:31:18', '2024-12-03 00:58:30', '2025-01-10 04:31:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(228, '2019 FORD FLEX SEL', '2019-ford-flex-sel', 'Used', 'Black', 'Grey', 'Ford', 'Automatic', 'FLEX', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'SEL', '<p>The 2019 Ford Flex SEL is a mid-size crossover SUV offering a spacious interior, distinctive boxy design, and practical functionality. It is powered by a 3.5L V6 engine delivering 287 horsepower and 254 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission. The SEL trim provides a smooth and comfortable ride, ideal for families and long road trips.</p><p><br></p><p>AWD: 14.7 L/100 km in the city and 10.7 L/100 km on the highway.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Standard features include a leather-wrapped steering wheel, dual-zone climate control, a power-adjustable driver\'s seat, an 8-inch touchscreen for the SYNC 3 infotainment system, and advanced safety features like rear parking sensors and a rearview camera and individual sunroof for each row.</p>', 'sold', 143230, 'km', 20500, '3.5L', '7', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"20\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"7 Seats\",\"Power Folding 3rd Row Seat\",\"Towing Package\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Advance Key\",\"Power Folding Mirror\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2019, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/nuZ9k8bcYNDOmtmCdVLoFIh2k3dfSJsThYun1JLx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dIQHmxlTHsW20oWWRaamql48SWAOLk1ut1fcvh0W.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ROXTb4Ulq3s6yiK2RIDKRBflSUj7b5ye6xNywFR5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cnmuhL2fCzlieFzmfFHZBOI4Eo9MR6d6ao2T1XOW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XZs6sItuNcFCNIMvh0JP00fYBzLN6BtcFDI6NADI.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mCWHWJn61ZmjCBrwIkh0UD98nRPjJwNfVh6l8Bc6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/bWL30FBD6xGguJjgVkiMyIVPjTqMut6yi6mcRtfn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EivRZmpLE2FYKKZhaGJvxoXJKwaYAG7EemhrHKse.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/pAecYe2sNtM1yzUfNMU1ftY9KJqOZ0L6FftowQF3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lTZIZZTWqhLdPkhBQyYtxaFXX3Czb3laL3k3I7h7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/47lv30X5LKdZV1HlUo1v52fqFPnexJhnn1YDteWc.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mzJmH7W7HJslOYnbsjTijJgEiYe7sHHV1u1EsBMQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/iTYR6cfo6qjoASsPFNXBiWGSYH2RAahXPYVY95fP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Nmoz4PF92BCoddiyRqnmKfMLYulJZ4ZvvRDjkHSB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SYjYkYosH9NU3T4lZrYGYvxu9br9xmlrRg6QWKxO.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vaVnrmp6S3mIerCUxixDNtVoSgaqJ2iO4Ql0UgGi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XWYRBZyWz9I6TyIV4kXuYRfDrQKwYHRCHJGBGzhs.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/sZJQjFk4lLlZ6xyRIvtLvE06vJPm6vJ4zmNvZ2xg.jpg\"]', 1, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:48', '2025-01-15 04:47:27', '2025-08-26 22:09:48', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=BI5M6a1Z3wYOsAdU4dvIyzR5OGk6%2FMX7&_gl=1*ot5syb*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', '2FMHK6C85KBA19819', '14.7L', '10.7L'),
(229, '2019 AUDI A3 PROGRESSIV SLINE', '2019-audi-a3-progressiv-sline', 'Used', 'Red', 'Black', 'Audi', '7 Speed Automatic', 'A3', 'Sedan', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium Plus', '<p>The 2019 Audi A3 Progressiv S Line is a premium compact sedan that blends sporty performance, elegant design, and advanced technology. Powered by a 2.0L turbocharged 4-cylinder engine, it produces 228 horsepower and 258 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 7-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission and Audi’s signature quattro all-wheel-drive system for dynamic handling and all-weather capability.</p><p><br></p><p>Fuel consumption ratings for the 2019 Audi A3 Progressiv S Line are:&nbsp;</p><p>City: 10.0 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p>Highway: 7.7 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Key features include S Line exterior styling enhancements, leather upholstery, a panoramic sunroof, dual-zone climate control, and a 7-inch MMI infotainment system with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto compatibility. Advanced safety features such as front and rear parking sensors, a rearview camera, and Audi pre-sense basic and city systems come standard, offering peace of mind on every journey.</p>', 'sold', 115611, 'km', 21000, '2.0L TURBO', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Parking sensors\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Panoramic Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"S-Line Package\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Surroundview Camera\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2019, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RDaY5p5GqdAyXYJMt0zMjDauBYoaFFgukwzIqN3y.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lQPODgu33aENaJDmFMuhLRk4HRKrWsyXpTnv54zX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Q1yqWU3bKyD81Z2GQi7DQ2BntKeBmmp1BT0aeiwP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/QenZQ7DK40JwZflUKpGhmYcJ5SGuFEnuehvPbHO2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/iilqax2liYDQAmbJzYrnb7mr7vKP0py0Bp5onJIQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vHptCGhB2V5PLAn99rBFbJ0RqWd7dHG6SvV68x5B.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/o3NDkgDWTt6ydSyB2kBKFVgakXQwy59wsuWbsf2g.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xPFf4ie9kybyNqmHSuscsOHuNLltscmEj5VXk1f2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DmZzrOBW11BEVEWx8ukkynUBee1sSzkELDvZV00O.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/h6ww54Nkzeg3QGSUejJ528lnnSQGfViBN5MiDuk6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZHtH7wxsCL34nNxsTCa5dVi5jPQTCxMOQDXGacrn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hFBmfbs9QIk7ljhoS742zKysy18c7JH1UIKMcvJT.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/LPilNVk1tf11SnY8UnLRb3uSq81SDw2ryvNADSqU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hQjk0C06NuJ5Udmt3D8aE5lTX649ahEtt3sxn0HM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vFBFGJGw9CBlTFtJn4eALz0EAZw99J36gOcM2nnZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/d6WhhKxPDaiMygsuQMuZXwoPCQytpzMXFFErqlz4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/isnFUFVBJxKEuo7Ko0ygcbfX7x6vkbDYG4T9rKIp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mlXcPb4ktxpGSPY0NoX76SZsNYefpwJAD4yZshu3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/P8lHEwOuNrEN2f7jHe1RJI7C28oywfcE8gMgSMhi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/IcBGYqiBA7NovlTm4jZu60k0W9n5M2KlYfYWXW4w.jpg\"]', 1, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:40', '2025-01-15 05:01:22', '2025-08-26 22:09:40', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=rig1ICeaea8nuMRhHiyb9%2FsuThe7keCK&_gl=1*1i13jfh*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', 'WAUJEGFF6K1017938', '10.0L', '7.7L'),
(230, '2017 GMC SIERRA 1500 SLT ALL TERRAIN', '2017-gmc-sierra-1500-slt-all-terrain', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'GMC', 'Automatic', 'Sierra 1500', 'Pickup', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>The 2017 GMC Sierra 1500 All Terrain is a rugged yet refined full-size pickup truck designed for off-road capability and everyday utility. It is powered by a 5.3L EcoTec3 V8 engine producing 355 horsepower and 383 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission and an advanced 4WD system with an Eaton automatic locking rear differential for superior traction on challenging terrains.</p><p><br></p><p>Fuel consumption ratings for the 2017 GMC Sierra 1500 All Terrain are:&nbsp;</p><p>City: 15.0 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p>Highway: 10.7 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The All Terrain trim includes unique styling elements like body-colored bumpers, a grille with chrome accents, off-road suspension, Rancho monotube shocks, and underbody skid plates. The interior features leather-appointed seating, an 8-inch GMC IntelliLink touchscreen with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto compatibility, dual-zone climate control, and a rearview camera. The truck offers robust towing and payload capabilities, making it a versatile choice for work and adventure.</p>', 'sold', 98000, 'km', 31500, '5.3L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Towing Package\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Air Cond. Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Remote start\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Heated steering\",\"LED Headlight\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ArS9PkvnKdVaqIrM8p15OVmLn26P24SGbQUvLCG5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AyCHFjKtSepIpZPay1AQDtf9V083zOVYNK5mmHWE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vgaASJesfXukM2UNqgQyf5Fwbnq6qGr33SfDzYmb.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hSkriQ223LJysf2SdDg6L8mDFrWDaR2ANu6uOPUp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XO7cMdJ1QjA82LjYkcpB6ttQVYNRLw0laQQjrL0V.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cENPtKcnrIFOyK2Vhx0HKWa5msDgOvbvjInzplWH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MWwG8ZwwAfa0fIGpADeIQ3XSwIEPf8voFQKAT00I.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lqes1RVFCGPvLjwT3jCUJDlmgyg9Ki5ok7KaO03b.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EG2PXrmQcEHoYBMsXSr7kypJtMrQ7ifFqwKIea0v.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/eUbksI1cWtlMlhde4vsYe54uuuv0WJyUhP5PRRGA.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3VPG9yYzgLaDO1kHb185TRrz07RCv7mEqNQNXRG1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lutGdX3JBBcL40kUymeqw6pTkkRm0tMGArfLUmYD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FHz896SLLtwSK6viXb7cUtweCGaFOumRKiuhKA2q.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/w4O2fJXudbmjsGdZQuHcNsiRq4M5Xl7Q1UrvqMZe.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/IgSYdwvDak11TBfMpDW1Pzg2bFgisKOO7k3e5ZaU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/T5L3HsnfFjsUZzokkOD0EF6Q0hLgURUvs4bFztMd.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/GzL753kxbV8lusbSNHyk1hmxR65uu3eHELWZkxbn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/zMttxQVkRfCXQD90NMT2I7WOVQvUTcDbrt8LWblR.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/NjMK1hEAigTO8MwxbKvDf5zS1XBWWVKP8C1lhldC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/aU0dqrfsnrDjC0O0x1lWCDIFpK1OobaxyvtJMf2d.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-01-15 05:12:05', '2025-05-24 23:13:21', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=38V5Uj0WI6JqlxPGrN9q33q%2FWGPpOiBl&_gl=1*1tdx1qv*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', '3GTU2NEC1HG497532', '15.0L', '10.7L'),
(231, '2020 HONDA CIVIC TOURING', '2020-honda-civic-touring', 'Used', 'Grey', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Civic', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'TOURING', '<p>The 2020 Honda Civic Touring is a top-tier compact sedan known for its blend of efficiency, comfort, and premium features. It is powered by a 1.5L turbocharged 4-cylinder engine that delivers 174 horsepower and 162 lb-ft of torque, paired with a continuously variable transmission (CVT) for smooth performance and excellent fuel efficiency.</p><p><br></p><p>Fuel consumption ratings for the 2020 Honda Civic Touring are:&nbsp;</p><p>City: 7.6 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p>Highway: 6.1 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>This trim offers luxury-focused features, including leather-trimmed seats, a power-adjustable driver\'s seat, dual-zone climate control, a 10-speaker premium audio system, and an advanced Honda Satellite-Linked Navigation System. The Civic Touring also comes with a suite of safety features through Honda Sensing®, such as adaptive cruise control, lane-keeping assist, forward collision warning, and a rearview camera. Its sleek design and refined interior make it a standout in the compact car segment.</p>', 'sold', 148600, 'km', 17997, '1.5L TURBO', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bose Sound\"]', 2020, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SviyvA7cHgqVSDbU2cqZbAdRhk05snvAUjbAKfs0.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2JpuJuBt48tK4rkwtuDMJ1PCvivF7XHIDYx2QoPJ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dygX7e8W1i3R3hNJYjEONqofmTpfzl1CPha6yKLX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xpXvDIgCTCTYLaCI3sVthLDUVEAcQHhONLnWhGrF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/R095YHpf7CAV8wPORAje9Y5Xy78hurWmGL70Y4wO.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DcgdMCh7e5mUybxgJNdI42baTgpUvuesdHWLPZWA.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/yHxnH0tfPbRWqaQmzEaDVamkc98iMTbMnrOdPkSE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7lrnwAa7YkiM9cKlxv09yKPL29YvsUfWFD3iab3W.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Z1IdFR8N3IMIWuj8aI2tMqCU4HBygN1QbwqqcDsT.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MxPiWWbkDCaLbulbQJZZN0lk1VdQoPJk4Ch4goib.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Bb7p6JQS2wrNlullMOZ9hs6d5dGdVh4ndlr3kHnE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/pgGrVl5Hb3CDUSQ093Z41wTgOBQCTFKCSi8R22x1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/kiK7mah8OojndE50L6QhCmV3mFvs4E88WM7Ksvt3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/nXTTpvuvraUS7TUvj1bbvmSbR7jfLh4tGHnrXFzF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qFLTiqm9hObKzun3P6iyNCnGFLz7aFlBO4QUQ67G.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/riJoVomWhgnHdpdIvJVNDSo6F2cBnLW5kpLS1upr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/GPfogIyCudn2CbvLqaNTbx3AJgCPOZDFC8bAThOR.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/31di1xv5iLASh32z77fD5BMtI71m4eFBHyPD8z7B.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AmdqlTdA28Xc6fNX7sXnPrQLuovyTrQY3mJImTX7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lTVj8DXmzpabYJcTFvZTf1BmjZsfDJKUm9rn16IQ.jpg\"]', 6, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-01-15 05:18:18', '2025-05-24 23:12:04', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=ZkYT0ViMDNFbjWDugr%2BH%2BiTGj7VFS63J&_gl=1*1n2fqr5*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', '2HGFC1F97LH104516', '7.6L', '6.1L'),
(232, '2017 BMW 230I PREMIUM M PACKAGE', '2017-bmw-230i-premium-m-package', 'Used', 'White', 'Red', 'BMW', 'Automatic', '230I', 'Convertible', 'AWD', '2', 'GAS', 'M PACKAGE', '<p>The 2017 BMW 230i with the M Package is a sporty compact coupe that delivers dynamic performance and sleek design. It is powered by a 2.0L turbocharged 4-cylinder engine producing 248 horsepower and 258 lb-ft of torque, paired with an 8-speed automatic transmission and BMW’s xDrive all-wheel-drive system for enhanced grip and handling in all conditions.</p><p><br></p><p>The M Package adds aggressive styling elements such as an aerodynamic body kit, larger alloy wheels, and sport-tuned suspension for improved driving dynamics. Inside, the 230xi features premium materials, sport seats with leather upholstery, a leather-wrapped M steering wheel, and aluminum trim accents. It’s a perfect blend of luxury and performance in a compact coupe.</p>', 'sold', 105500, 'km', 22500, '2.0L', '4', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Leather seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Power Seats\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Surroundview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Harman Kardon Sound\",\"M-Sport Pkg\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Heated steering\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DXMgIj2PpIXuiMadlolticGwsv4YvAhT5oQI8TfL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Rzv9iMwikNcJdwpo7z86WTad8YOiXTBYgxSalWQP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/rDwBvW7BC9MkOMsXYKmPmxQf0MXGVeaFbpPyrGX1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cvoMg8XFBn9Z7FKpWHLQPXYkx3I238hFvnO5j2hx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/sSrO8MChudhyX8kL15euzOClYabGYbBLyIMD3z1n.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1jpqiFipNaBxv1o0lB620AJLzXdzUZGez1vOxmfL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7Y4Su8sh89F1PjoRhUBCDswwk16aaWMTH1UDKeXt.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RHRqCWnYL5ASX7Od3MS4amBTmQjd27jUinLX35We.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/lnieeRPcEZBxlpR0hQcHVWub10kCCl0Pyt64K7oH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/6w3QwAw372l8ErQ0UD0kJNoIICgi2tUQ1YEzjs9S.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MHFhdw1wbdELyOVgxqOnEAypblYEb4CqxNroPv3x.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4c974qp8xKT3oLvUXJMO8Jib4QrCPcK9k1RqvSFY.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/HruvDqWDqVd6k7LbnBFtkkvyWj5R8go26ChyuSBo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dmiam8ACMmYZJxt40DyuYN1URBkW77Gx1THJ1GN7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DTV9i9aStvSQLWJQju4LWU58nn17UXPfXG06vuDH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ukII5QzYBWDiN2tfUA1xFAgHJTJa1yPt6HnGoKJ2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2SOWoVF2zPMphw4MgeiNcHNSESvu4rk75rfWzpAr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/pO8ZGmck7R9ydMmEjnBJA0a69UrhO7DhB0hEu7h8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ibmHPqsTeY4MHZGFATw9o6HDfCgq9S1guSsBpx1L.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/goJpF1oYMeaOzt721ID6gGok06ktiyZpZ6q8Gd3K.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-01-15 23:33:03', '2025-04-19 04:09:31', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=XLdjMWGKkrQcsi6%2FgP1IDVELUdDt7%2F6%2B&_gl=1*wxxsg5*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', 'WBA2M9C54HV717053', '10.2L', '7.3L');
INSERT INTO `cars` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `technical_condition`, `ext_color`, `int_color`, `make`, `transmission`, `model`, `body_type`, `drive`, `door`, `fuel`, `trim`, `description`, `availability`, `mileage`, `mileage_unit`, `price`, `engine`, `seats`, `features`, `year`, `images`, `featured_image_index`, `featured`, `user_id`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `video_link`, `carfax_link`, `vin`, `city_fuel_consumption`, `highway_fuel_consumption`) VALUES
(233, '2016 NISSAN NV2500 HD', '2016-nissan-nv2500-hd', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Nissan', 'Automatic', 'NV 2500HD', 'VAN', 'RWD', '2', 'GAS', 'S', '<p>The 2016 Nissan NV2500 SV is a versatile and robust full-size cargo van designed for demanding commercial use. It is powered by a 4.0L V6 engine delivering 261 horsepower and 281 lb-ft of torque, paired with a 5-speed automatic transmission.</p><p><br></p><p>Fuel consumption for the 2016 Nissan NV2500 SV varies slightly by configuration but averages:&nbsp;</p><p>City: 16.8 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p>Highway: 12.4 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The SV trim adds practical features such as rear parking sensors, a rearview camera, upgraded cloth upholstery, and additional storage options. With a spacious cargo area, durable build, and high roof option for increased vertical capacity, the NV2500 SV is ideal for businesses requiring reliable transportation for goods or equipment. The van also offers advanced safety features and a user-friendly infotainment system, making it both functional and comfortable for long days on the road.</p>', 'sold', 199500, 'km', 12786, '4.0L', '2', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2016, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/55ISwkUD0ZsAY4y2VLkfDSy4xUELVDWqDddC3p7A.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MMAUr4mdcEr3PcDYMqpI60FLIWSnFniX2bRNNLHD.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XifP4v1gs8S3AYTIuJkA0vfWOLBFEERiHXOcm2E5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/oc0D87H6pPTseuSZlAWQMLUp90sazMjIcSlBQXBJ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mXyygiIjDZMr40NdYAu6VgHYo3jzykZYKjjPPkoN.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MdoF8wjATy2Uc7PbaWWh9ybN8DDkyx2atSU3QzH1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Uf8RPaXsOjSUH6Y6zKfgwBejOAzSdServ56cMHSn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/BJUj17HttL0i7ht0GgDgxj8KPd8b1SgDSRIrD6o6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/g1sbf0KdpHpbCll28z5WqjKlJ0QfqnZ1jZu1mk1D.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RYseaaVlQhHvU72pdGAQIadpv5SqRMCkqD5SLvrw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/jZ77Qd3E8025wbAMzu3iPeEmlHrUv6iZjOqYcTxL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/nTKix03fQ72DxahhceL5b7qvIP4OrDa5K2rctbDZ.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-01-16 00:25:31', '2025-04-19 04:20:46', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=ngj7hJRN9PuUMP7nQAiLSJhjIMZuZ%2BF%2B&_gl=1*1spf0n0*_gcl_au*MTU1NjA3MDU3NS4xNzM2ODkwNzI1', '1N6BF0KY7GN805109', '16.8L', '12.4L'),
(234, '2011 MAZDA MX-5', '2011-mazda-mx-5', 'Used', 'Grey', 'Brown', 'Mazda', 'Manual', 'MX-5', 'Convertible', 'RWD', '2', 'GAS', 'GT PREMIUM', '<p>The 2011 Mazda MX-5 Miata Hardtop Convertible with a manual transmission is a compact sports car that delivers an exhilarating driving experience with exceptional precision and control. Powered by a 2.0L 4-cylinder engine, it generates 167 horsepower and 140 lb-ft of torque, paired exclusively with a 6-speed manual gearbox for a true enthusiast’s connection to the road.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Fuel consumption for the manual transmission model is:&nbsp;</p><p>City: 9.7 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p>Highway: 7.1 L/100 km&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>This model features a power-retractable hardtop for seamless transitions between coupe-like comfort and open-air excitement. The full-option trim includes premium leather upholstery, heated seats, automatic climate control, a Bose premium audio system, and advanced safety features such as dynamic stability and traction control. With its lightweight design and perfectly balanced rear-wheel-drive layout, the 2011 MX-5 Miata manual offers pure driving pleasure.</p>', 'sold', 41511, 'km', 14999, '2.0L', '2', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Leather seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Power Seats\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2011, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Wwu8nomYMiJemZXZt7J6LTPD2VD3oWybuMIdzRyV.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-01-16 00:38:31', '2025-08-26 22:08:55', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=KLvpIM3f9Pq33pUfCMoW95R/Sp2otbed', 'JM1NC2PF8B0215003', '9.7L', '7.1L'),
(235, '2016 HONDA PILOT EX-L', '2016-honda-pilot-ex-l', 'Used', 'Black', 'Grey', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'PILOT', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'EX-L', '<p>The 2018 Honda Pilot EX-L Navi is a versatile, family-friendly SUV that combines comfort, technology, and efficiency. It comes equipped with a 3.5-liter V6 engine paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission, offering 280 horsepower. The EX-L trim adds luxurious features such as leather upholstery, a power-adjustable driver’s seat, and a sunroof, while the Navi package includes a built-in navigation system, a rearview camera, and Apple CarPlay/Android Auto integration. For safety, it features Honda Sensing, including collision mitigation, lane-keeping assist, and adaptive cruise control.</p><p><br></p>', 'sold', 135000, 'km', 23000, '3.5L', '7', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"7 Seats\",\"Towing Package\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2016, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FsRRg81cxPKiN4qyksGlOXQWU2qeunEtPsUnVn0o.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XuBVe7t0WlWWOjt2OhGGyBPet5Jb77enJVBdk9Oa.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Avwz2glMaFgPyuCqtcLOiiPTgodvIXlQmyMhNXth.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FTcWwOKP2rCxsWKpfKfmhKWoUTSVOmWCK3Eg1Q6t.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/u0jTySnYsY5un8cebtmXxosmCYLTz08DAF4M96nv.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2xArleemWuyzH4oLXQvJ2wTvQO3AeGH1RBfTOR51.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/22Gf3oHpXXGqodPY37kcd5dgdXb51DM4fzngJS0K.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/p5zTKz6DRd8qj2QKV8nzm1zr2wPRX6Rl4DtZ9luW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/bpXepnumzCi53DF9ihI7yjOGswJ747HBqqyVUtNE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/805MdFVr0YxN7O5wTYKHUXiTpF6wdKcTc12hHGca.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/YgqtviGsKnBuTA3C20Sdzt4Sa7nVXamnJipUZCpv.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SzcK5CZqMuMzY3MC5jZiJNHTVwhHx8DiIPddmJxi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/AO8fD5KpCHClYNay3UI9XXb01k7Zfty4UX4ohwXd.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/KrRRgibVBPpcQH8AlHr0bSIsGqclhBZQuOpyIPce.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/kquVD38abFelVVIo8QxfdDx8iq2hVDVvIsO4F3Nt.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fWP729fl34y7Pw2Ynn4LwAYYUjBYTmKJWiGrRRf2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FaYtfS8HqaUZB1ZTVMcIMGmeHy0cicm4cprgeHh8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/USxJYwRvSMA98YvpaoBfZM6ndfqPHlWH8buayR3k.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tKZHdbUa4twHKpNYa9liFXPYvv1gb8YLsKoVSrn2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Kfp71eh2zpMsUkEyGoPJ87dz9NJfIqR7duoe8eUw.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:33', '2025-02-09 01:03:59', '2025-08-26 22:09:33', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=mhk35d4JsgZ6A%2BO5vZkq7kUCFMj8z20%2F&_gl=1*6lc482*_gcl_au*MTcwNDIzMTk3MS4xNzM3MTMzMzAy', '5FNYF6H78GB506404', '11.9L', '8.3L'),
(236, '2017 BMW 330I XDRIVE', '2017-bmw-330i-xdrive', 'Used', 'Silver', 'Black', 'BMW', 'Automatic', '330i', 'Sedan', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>Looking for a luxury sedan that’s fun to drive and ready for any weather? Check out this 2017 BMW 330i xDrive! It’s powered by a turbocharged 2.0L 4-cylinder engine with 248 hp, paired with BMW’s smooth 8-speed automatic and xDrive all-wheel drive—giving you a confident, sporty ride whether it’s sunny or snowing.</p><p>This one comes loaded with premium features like heated leather seats, a sunroof, dual-zone climate control, Bluetooth, and BMW’s iDrive infotainment system. The cabin is clean, upscale, and built for comfort, with enough space for family or friends in the back.</p><p>Well-maintained and ready to roll, this 330i xDrive is perfect if you want luxury, performance, and year-round capability—all in one sleek package.</p><p><br></p><p>Comes with 2 2-year power terrain warranty, including engine and transmission for your peace of mind.</p>', 'available', 158900, 'km', 14995, '2.0', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Harman Kardon Sound\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7azxFdK4XUpnoSurcrLpe7MDmUOzs46I3ChVq6lE.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/IYChUBsFLcmZPZN3Cc5EMU9s5hgmJYCu3txVBFvM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/E3DD2fxiSr7vIxRaZAx6xHZ4jhfeTnjcM01JRtAW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xDLVPiwK9h7WY5af4Pfi2xRXyxsrZuRfBhwOgETL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/9X2UFdr12LYmiunPx71CZEmJJHEVYqRMr7HZopd1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/O53mpWGfw8k2j6CbwCBB4RKUoMAORSYEVftdtnIW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/0HCquSwAtjNGDuiRX8PiwmDpe7EX0DR8qP5qDe8r.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2NYaq3cFfwKM8JL8crTMW9iHtNWqcgfIg4hxsKbU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RxVVHI82Pr8J6Ux7IivA74YJgHi7VchEXVbORy1t.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1FIeNEGS68RUPA0NjP0Kc70r7Cu3aytLAPZ80Ekp.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tckhBfDtCDDA3g12HVN3qNqPXmTaiF1azvBFRkqv.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/XZZLgop0YOf7YNUqEMPakt4I9r4ar90w4LoIWtW0.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3BFm0d3Wb1jyPQlHh77VZ7fXkc8ITVQInWQGM5h7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tT5WKY8rIZkybFlHSQAoeA6moPjojRsmLGL2u73U.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/UfS9dmZk1ALbCvVCmJ1aAOFCiN917KZ1RMvi5cB9.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/gVk5MahvchgkQNqiYUbejJf0Gpu4hFvJ2EkEluBu.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vfmDbByqjpv8ozKQpug5ecBPqvcEuVA1x0ObZHHq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4AthluJNt29FitXO1SCbneH966Z7CYRiqhZJSlx0.jpg\"]', 7, 1, 1, '2025-08-26 22:08:47', '2025-04-19 04:41:11', '2025-08-26 22:08:47', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=VDzyOn%2Batk2Ki4FAjuHmH1JF%2FeJIlvwm', 'WBA8D9C51HA003642', '9.1L', '7.4L'),
(237, '2020 JAGUAR F-PACE PRESTIGE', '2020-jaguar-f-pace-prestige', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Jaguar', '8 Speed Automatic', 'F-TYPE', 'Suv', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Prestige', '<p>Experience refined British engineering with this 2020 Jaguar F-PACE Prestige 25t, a luxury SUV that delivers style, comfort, and spirited performance. With a sleek exterior design and a premium, tech-filled cabin, this vehicle is perfect for drivers who want elegance without sacrificing capability.</p><p><strong>Vehicle Highlights:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Engine:</strong> 2.0L Turbocharged Inline-4 (247 hp, 269 lb-ft torque)</li><li><strong>Transmission:</strong> 8-Speed Automatic with All-Wheel Drive</li><li><strong>Fuel Economy:</strong> 9.9L/100 km combined (10.7 city / 8.8 highway)</li></ul><p><strong>Features Include:</strong></p><ul><li>Premium leather interior with heated front seats</li><li>10-inch Touch Pro™ infotainment system with navigation</li><li>Meridian™ premium sound system</li><li>Dual-zone climate control</li><li>Power tailgate</li><li>Front and rear parking sensors</li><li>Lane Keep Assist and Emergency Braking</li><li>19\" alloy wheels</li></ul><p>This F-PACE Prestige 25t offers the perfect blend of sporty performance and upscale luxury. Whether you\'re commuting in the city or heading out on a weekend trip, this SUV delivers comfort, safety, and performance every mile of the way.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Financing and extended warranty options are available. Trade-ins welcome.</em></strong></p>', 'sold', 67500, 'km', 29995, '2.0', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Panoramic Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Air Cond. Seats\",\"20\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Surroundview Camera\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2020, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/vjb9HjscRFayPfuHaRZHa4SFENxOrDNmjAzjKhGL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/JcviTDtsMOxdWYp9YJgy0NeXfbv1ITbYHHkRDwfx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/uMbrsMpReJaWfrdV3Hia91g3DKwXq4nhxcibddHc.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/QAqJXTq6lK30a3l9KzUcGCXlT3dxtaJodiwtyOI3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/L3Fh8PcSiQr7d5qb7Cd5CCAH0XpJbSGkyQzpF9qn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RlJ8oVwnWYNAAy0N2SbKVOAcWr5CxtRkHOgaO6Ge.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/RNqFJNA2NtBBSTYR9c8x6oMCwqoEkuvHVPnKTcSi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fvbVPDnmYatL6JVQllXUmf3WofsGVctiGX8r17y8.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1mEoYASFMctoccVB8jd6zYX1f1UlojkmEjNzWiL6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/yGBend5Brnsa2U0TIehF8CMhgf0u9Ni1RxhzV788.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/uLXMAzL4RodGmqGBalTGkRDY3LrlEHo9qaSZcUgo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2ORTiKJRw2mk0LLOdeRyKGJRfnCXHBcPBnOpHTzu.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/V02uLozkYCIgZESRAGZv8iRj53CHgjcGIeuiWfcq.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/BtkHGP9shcvxRQWhYAAheYuHBupQPAHQuD1hySb5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tLsDeaIeshwP2DGZidSQV6LQPPFh7Sj54WpaLfhO.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/zYD6zSqE1cENTEl4a0PIdeQUF2Si7ulJkHGWEnRr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/uxeCQws9rpkwBXzy12inhu5HJIFo9OLEtVZFbwfA.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dDfMqkcedUTeKiwUhaCkduY3npXAY60Vr8rD5oQ3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/idpGg769brkOsQBjb3QxxpgbUwcl8hMsAlklLxXh.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/IkqueRzEet0FAUuFmitLIXoIKeuBk65OTslEXU6A.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:29', '2025-04-19 04:56:33', '2025-08-26 22:09:29', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=CueH0mD7gQTaNTyC%2BWPwmf%2FItGo0fHi5', 'SADCK2FX4LA662478', '10.7L', '8.8L'),
(238, '2018 HONDA ACCORD EX-L', '2018-honda-accord-ex-l', 'Used', 'Grey', 'Black', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Accord', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'EX-L', '<p>Enjoy luxury and efficiency in this <strong>2018 Honda Accord EX-L</strong> – a stylish, feature-packed sedan perfect for everyday driving.</p><p><strong>Specs &amp; Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Engine:</strong> 1.5L Turbocharged I4, 192 hp</li><li><strong>Transmission:</strong> CVT, FWD</li><li><strong>Fuel Economy:</strong> 7.2 L/100 km combined</li><li><strong>Leather interior</strong> with heated front &amp; rear seats</li><li><strong>Apple CarPlay &amp; Android Auto</strong></li><li><strong>Power sunroof, remote start, blind spot monitor</strong></li><li><strong>Premium audio system, dual-zone climate control</strong></li></ul><p>Well-maintained, comfortable, and packed with tech, this Accord is ready to hit the road.</p><p><br></p><p>Warranty and financing are available.</p>', 'sold', 72500, 'km', 21500, '1.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Power Seat with Memories\",\"Bose Sound\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8rhmUIV9SNtdeXONod4TmlRGs1LFajc41zZU7dMg.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/NAa407a4FTBdNfWseT3FWQw69Ttj9K0004xTDE7A.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2Oh5RdgvIDGsQChC2WSHvIYUKOaWl1Rp7BPzboFV.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1wFEmDvgrmgeTxPNppJwpTaD5L2knUJ8lOWRB7QZ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/9zg6g7DFFYsuMVfnESQteQNCXbB5Nqj7qmdaaE9J.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1w4co2gsscHj4B6X98BdWeTHwgjhdRAzgtA3GP2l.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5tB5DxJLIBk50SpsVYvjJ8f0EaZvlzzoodzWYV27.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/VN0YRrMFMT02WrZXAvbik645jE8NrtpF34WCWYmk.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SRuhwEmCxdzLSVDdE6OHLs8QrzjhulOUOZ2orncA.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8X8pzZwZPzF40bYj2XqCEiBfUcpFchOFQg1mepZ6.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1KlFDu7rOTkkVJ3ASu8ujuEFIuUFG386AjPLIqod.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1wqRAbTlW9Gxm29PJW4yVABYIhYQQBp32HZarqC4.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/1bAJZXjtPR1T5ioWEwavXfFeZt6HbcycHQLWkehl.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Q4yGClJaQcKEhwlp0SCvjsxVet1WtNaSSRXAoBdy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/8aIvPeFVpxNghZn9TqaeldPV5GDkjv6pbm6cQZZW.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/3VTDtfavjd1JsXRztaDB98OgR8c6uw6uoYqAiSVO.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/CcQjTfxshvIc57uf07JLcILA8tXwpXJY3QsfklAx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/e2lbNJF8iJnR4GB2fFFwdhHOmd0iemQCHiohpyJy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qUuQ0VBpjMW35MoKwOKDfRmwmL7yUR1KSfWUmXDt.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/rxKpuTbQniwAd0VaL77fuTwNHO0zzRQGchCSg20D.jpg\"]', 2, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:24', '2025-04-19 05:11:04', '2025-08-26 22:09:24', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=nkeD8gRJ2VVLteptgodQcC5Vyz6aj0wB', '1HGCV1F52JA811318', '7.9L', '6.3L'),
(239, '2017 MERCEDES BENZ METRIS PASSENGER', '2017-mercedes-benz-metris-passenger', 'Used', 'Dark Grey', 'Black', 'Mercedes-Benz', 'Automatic', 'METRIS', 'Minivan', 'RWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium', '<p>Discover the perfect blend of functionality and comfort with this <strong>2017 Mercedes-Benz Metris Passenger Van</strong>. Designed for both family adventures and business needs, it offers ample space and reliable performance.</p><p><strong>Key Specifications:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Engine:</strong> 2.0L Turbocharged Inline-4, 208 hp, 258 lb-ft torque</li><li><strong>Transmission:</strong> 7-speed automatic with manual mode</li><li><strong>Drivetrain:</strong> Rear-Wheel Drive</li><li><strong>Fuel Economy:</strong> 11.5 L/100 km city / 9.3 L/100 km highway / 10.5 L/100 km combined </li><li><strong>Seating Capacity:</strong> Up to 8 passengers</li><li><strong>Cargo Space:</strong> 1,099 liters behind the third row</li><li><strong>Towing Capacity:</strong> Up to 2,268 kg (5,000 lbs) </li></ul><p><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Manual sliding side doors</li><li>Bluetooth connectivity</li><li>Rear air conditioning</li><li>17-inch steel wheels</li><li>Optional safety features: blind-spot monitoring, lane-keeping assist, and rearview camera </li></ul><p>This Metris Passenger Van is a reliable and spacious vehicle, ideal for transporting groups comfortably.</p><p><br></p><p><em>Financing options are available. Trade-ins welcome.</em></p>', 'available', 62500, 'km', 31995, '2.0', '8', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/rAqETuPLK1Jjes714UAnMs9NyY59Hl2JDQmlMKlK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Ha0kTGqK8cku41tse2hlh2BVWtrj6pleeCifClbQ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/LaZP38o8w125NQhDh6NXnO46l6BDh3Oszs8FM5Oo.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EpxxbgW45roTx0Gnprz67KeJsY32842GTm4ZxXK2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/FudNPiSvvTPUHhFGvmdVQtrPQQ3w6qa5ON3XZAnL.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/bQVV39gPRdnBHpyhVQ4ZuJywS1Xyf8ea1cbycJSS.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/KQ3EHgWjaNsl7nOFXkOe5otcxEuJpk7RBOvxakT5.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/n1h3ExIx2ND2rVzqehn7HIOS0pVDwm3ci1S7lURC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7vVcm2ONOz4OZkm35NkB3UsBArzXrfcWAimvMu5L.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5q06tqg3d5P8opTj77KfbQ05sEMh6VJlDwty4vt2.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/VDISnKT08WXBvTPwKzKSOtMa0pq9jvwbBR4pVQ82.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:08:43', '2025-04-19 05:22:32', '2025-08-26 22:08:43', NULL, 'https://dealer.carfax.ca/MyReports', 'V', '11.5L', '9.3L'),
(240, '2015 AUDI A4 PREMIUM PLUS', '2015-audi-a4-premium-plus', 'Used', 'White', 'Black', 'Audi', 'Automatic', 'A4', 'Sedan', 'AWD', '4', 'GAS', 'Premium Plus', '<p>Turn heads with this <strong>2015 Audi A4 Premium Plus</strong>, a refined luxury sedan enhanced with tasteful performance upgrades. This A4 not only delivers premium comfort and German engineering, it’s also been modified for a sportier edge.</p><p><strong>Key Specs:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Engine:</strong> 2.0L Turbocharged Inline-4</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> 220 hp / 258 lb-ft torque</li><li><strong>Transmission:</strong> 8-Speed Automatic with Quattro All-Wheel Drive</li><li><strong>Fuel Economy:</strong> 9.4 L/100 km combined</li></ul><p><strong>Performance Upgrades:</strong></p><ul><li>Lowered on <strong>aftermarket lowering springs</strong> for improved stance and handling</li><li><strong>Cold air intake</strong> and upgraded <strong>intake pipe</strong> for enhanced throttle response and airflow</li></ul><p><strong>Premium Plus Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Leather interior with power/heated front seats</li><li>Sunroof, keyless entry &amp; push-button start</li><li>Audi MMI infotainment system with Bluetooth and navigation</li><li>Xenon headlights with LED DRLs</li><li>18\" alloy wheels</li></ul><p>This Audi A4 combines luxury with lightly modded performance, perfect for driving enthusiasts who want comfort with character.</p><p><br></p><p> <em>Test drives available. Financing options and trade-ins accepted.</em></p>', 'sold', 117800, 'km', 14500, '2.0', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Xenon\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Leather seats\",\"Sunroof\",\"All Wheel Drive\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Upgraded Soft Leather\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Bose Sound\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2015, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/qi2cOuo9Df9i7Dosmt7LyYi30rnLTsKoi7gVfIRw.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/w4NY05fuilvvW99ocVz7zffSz7QYrqd4oahW4sgy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Hp6qwFyAwC6WWNWUQmriBiAGRCsh1nBiRZQx48I1.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/M76QdzDoGkLwkTJ6Cid3YFqH7LC5yUtkHO2QnHgd.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mzuMH54ksSoqSQszj1EmKyKbKsO5GclgGGcpfr6R.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZjlPiLYJNeMBIUnKvvDIYTLLkqVOcgLPgnrCDtxN.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/957nVP8p0u9slEvzAQ99vCdJnVS9vqzygxSa6fnK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cqnshIleObuaVZVegxrzFy4fqpwHWOpezmyRUMjk.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/L5dCHXB3o15jBg5q2pXGlZLLCuIbKxMFUpEhBezn.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/DwTcgfmLrCjy84XPupwghfoFYL51kzPVVF9FYq7v.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2GLU4pq2NoaIYarc92v6vGUKJzFZEVgDbh6SIuCv.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/EULsNOx5oGEfXTHluwDTLUops8ppYKnHH9Ov2XLm.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/7jTJmnTb4FhmU93BUbAPTty7E0Oq0MupfNbYzQi3.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/xPXmOfbybY33IxCuCNgjjXedfYzkLniKryVkEYQP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/OROdNvClRiuTYwo5Ba7eBBnLtHGnNK3ryxRz8edP.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Hkxy6LVSKNYwTFSFWH6wTLzWFoEKUyCRWjJgAKiB.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/HT7k0ZMdIbmGCXklww1KwRwmQdwlB9SYT1BZV0dJ.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/SsJlH4kFsfPGSag3bSJZ67S7S3QNzQelPGNTNlRS.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WhUSge9vbE5IT3B8G5mTSC2W79wtbHQYlwbdNkcu.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/5VKUa9LkBrYwjqBKxzChUuYX1ZQyBrXxLXBon1VE.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-26 22:09:19', '2025-04-19 05:34:03', '2025-08-26 22:09:19', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=x9E%2Fv%2FHY6zCxAogWiNZP7sKAgc59hT7P', 'WAUFFCFL4FN000927', '10.7L', '7.6L'),
(241, '2014 HONDA CIVIC LX', '2014-honda-civic-lx-1', 'Used', 'Black', 'Grey', 'Honda', 'Automatic', 'Civic', 'Sedan', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'LX', '<p>Looking for a reliable daily driver with excellent fuel economy? This 2014 Honda Civic LX delivers comfort, performance, and proven Honda reliability. Powered by a 1.8L 4-cylinder engine paired with a smooth CVT transmission, this sedan is perfect for city commutes and weekend getaways.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>1.8L I4 Engine with CVT</li><li>Bluetooth HandsFreeLink &amp; Streaming Audio</li><li>Heated seats</li><li>Econ Mode for enhanced fuel efficiency</li><li>Power windows, locks, and mirrors</li><li>Cruise control &amp; tilt/telescoping steering wheel</li><li>Spacious interior with 60/40 split rear seats</li></ul><p>Fuel Economy:</p><ul><li>City: 7.5 L/100 km</li><li>Highway: 5.5 L/100 km</li><li>Combined: 6.6 L/100 km</li></ul><p>This Civic LX has been well-maintained and is ready for its next owner. Whether you\'re a first-time buyer or looking for a budget-friendly commuter, this Civic is a smart choice.</p><p><br></p><p>2 years extended warranty included </p><p>financing available</p><p><br></p><p>Contact us today to schedule a test drive!</p><p><br></p>', 'sold', 75200, 'km', 11995, '1.8L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2014, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/iCeaFJjyrbuSsdIdbcGjgHnfuw9qqEl808ZSh8Wj.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/01MKOevatcriehb62uZpoASAE7wddEhmPsnbURSi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/UiWXYrnBscaMOpA4i1k0YBUV9hHBXE8ox3bl8WMF.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/PjdjbWJ4OwzZVsNpJG9srTESPhgMa9BTZa4PJxLK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/k6N9ZKTQ8BsU7QingYFaDkkBTF54OI9mfKmKl4qU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/a7wacajIAC5xj7fsaaKo3roxDGDt18N2SKaHuvAK.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/4vun1rnI0OqS7KOlgKIHp20TvzmJOLawvO6P5qEy.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/f0Db2wX6iqRUEccSITwH0PBXTDf2xlPAVXP6KOUx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/p2XRDtgV98gNfwvsA9MnEuEKaHryWolzPiTv815U.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/GJCNxzInL12RhroFnmK72IXvYmECJjjq17w99o6V.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/WUUTi6OMtyL9JYAxaoKxN9Bywoo2LXhBOqTu50FX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/tz7QdVfpRg1Sfj405ZIG9mok6Xa9YJXpxYxBWFHX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/KUBPM1qqi1foYq2l89Uz27eBBr4KocxElxvKVA13.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/kO8xrbv0UvRl3z6pAhLWUHlluMlI5ZMSriODWoyi.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/D6RGw9Ktm2iIQdJUZCIuMrNNkJIRupDBLk6vIIhr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/MruVbVJZe9OAVa4Y8bYFhj4ntZZZCe2683WpbdCK.jpg\"]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-04-30 22:43:09', '2025-05-13 00:48:18', NULL, 'https://vhr.carfax.ca/?id=Dr6af%2FM1QUT6Wgeli9UK5VWj3cjX9Dka', '2HGFB2F49EH041130', '7.5L', '5.5L'),
(242, '2018 CHEVROLET EQUINOX', '2018-chevrolet-equinox', 'Used', 'White', 'Grey', 'Chevrolet', 'Automatic', 'EQUINOX', 'Suv', 'FWD', '4', 'GAS', 'LT', '<p>Looking for a versatile and fuel-efficient SUV that doesn’t compromise on comfort or tech? The 2018 Chevrolet Equinox LT offers modern styling, advanced safety features, and a spacious interior perfect for families or daily driving. Powered by a turbocharged 1.5L engine with a 6-speed automatic transmission, this SUV delivers a smooth, confident ride with great fuel economy for its class.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>1.5L Turbocharged 4-Cylinder Engine</li><li>6-Speed Automatic Transmission with Overdrive</li><li>Apple CarPlay &amp; Android Auto</li><li>7\" Touchscreen Display</li><li>Rear Vision Camera</li><li>Power Driver’s Seat</li><li>Heated Front Seats</li><li>Keyless Entry &amp; Push-Button Start</li><li>Split-Folding Rear Seats for Extra Cargo Space</li></ul><p>Fuel Economy:</p><ul><li>City: 9.2 L/100 km</li><li>Highway: 7.3 L/100 km</li><li>Combined: 8.3 L/100 km</li></ul><p>This Equinox LT is a great option for drivers looking for SUV space with sedan-like efficiency. Clean, comfortable, and well-equipped—ready for your next adventure.</p><p>Contact us today to book a test drive!</p><p>Would you like a version of this tailored for a specific mileage or vehicle condition?</p>', 'available', 88800, 'km', 17995, '1.5L', '5', '[\"Traction control\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Power Seats\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Active Curise Control\",\"Remote start\",\"HEATED SEATS\"]', 2018, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/PknggxxGg8mZiGWQWYrydEeKIgGHJcQOhB7u9u8i.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/cKNelHiQiR3ynOCbuCGhPQ9S5ltXIJpprGpOasnX.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/f3ZyKK8mgM4khvn8OLIFTBchYDoqj4M56I859guM.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/jxQ1Y2qPVb563zulKLrwS8e8nyvBixrS8PPcXEkx.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/fUi91MW56iZNCAHclTAzOpkeUn9ykQCTxxA78SeJ.jpg\",\"\\/