(243, '2021 GMC SIERRA 1500 AT4', '2021-gmc-sierra-1500-at4', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'GMC', 'Automatic', 'Sierra 1500', 'Pickup', '4WD', '4', 'GAS', 'AT4', '<p>The 2021 GMC Sierra 1500 AT4 is the epitome of rugged capability and refined luxury, now with an impressive 6.2L V8 engine under the hood. This powerhouse, paired with a 10-speed automatic transmission, offers 420 horsepower and 460 lb-ft of torque, ensuring you have the muscle to take on any challenge, from off-road trails to heavy-duty towing. With advanced off-road features, a plush interior, and cutting-edge technology, the Sierra AT4 is built for those who demand both performance and comfort.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>6.2L V8 Engine with 420 hp &amp; 460 lb-ft of torque</li><li>10-Speed Automatic Transmission</li><li>Off-Road AT4 Suspension Package with Rancho shocks</li><li>MultiPro Tailgate for versatile cargo solutions</li><li>8\" GMC Infotainment System with Navigation</li><li>Apple CarPlay &amp; Android Auto</li><li>Wireless Charging &amp; Remote Start</li><li>Premium Leather Seating with AT4-specific detailing</li><li>Heated and Ventilated Front Seats</li><li>Integrated Trailer Brake Controller</li><li>4WD with locking rear differential</li></ul><p>Fuel Economy:</p><ul><li>City: 15.0 L/100 km</li><li>Highway: 11.2 L/100 km</li><li>Combined: 13.0 L/100 km</li></ul><p>Whether you’re hauling heavy loads, conquering rugged terrains, or simply enjoying the luxurious ride, the 2021 GMC Sierra 1500 AT4 brings together power, comfort, and advanced technology for a premium driving experience.</p><p>Contact us today to book your test drive and feel the power for yourself!</p><p><br></p><p>2 years extended warranty included</p><p>financing available for all kinds of credit</p>', 'available', 223200, 'km', 34995, '6.2L', '5', '[\"Parking sensors\",\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Leather seats\",\"Fully Loaded\",\"Power Seats\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"Sunroof\",\"LED Headlight\",\