(251, 'NISSAN 370 Z', 'nissan-370-z', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Nissan', 'Manual', '370 Z COUPE', 'Coupe', 'RWD', '2', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p><strong>The Nissan 370Z Coupe is a stylish two-door sports car with a bold design.</strong></p><p><strong>It is powered by a responsive 3.7-litre V6 engine that delivers strong performance.</strong></p><p><strong>The car offers precise handling and an engaging driving experience.</strong></p><p><strong>Its rear-wheel-drive layout provides excellent balance on the road.</strong></p><p><strong>The interior features supportive sport seats and a driver-focused cockpit.</strong></p><p><strong>Modern technology includes Bluetooth connectivity and available navigation.</strong></p><p><strong>The 370Z Coupe is known for its reliability and durable engineering.</strong></p><p><strong>Its sleek exterior gives it a timeless and aggressive appearance.</strong></p><p><strong>The vehicle is suitable for both daily driving and weekend adventures.</strong></p><p><strong>Overall, the Nissan 370Z Coupe is an exciting sports car that combines performance, comfort, and style</strong></p>', 'available', 98666, 'km', 19999, '3.7', '2', '[\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"Rearview Camera\",\"21\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Sport Seats\",\"Lane Keep Assist\",\"Smart Key\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/u4XjkF27ePhwOOL2YtcxNc308Xem5wLN0dPfNcvr.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/ZZ1jy4VhSoeL3uWSkBAN7iQO1FNZrkVozW2Ucv8d.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/mMGxCuR2cSaa5IIDhZcQdZtABa2eN8qtL1wwBDGH.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Gm75yhQBUqKIEULf27aWQPDyEUuXh4B6svh55Pr7.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2DXy4qGc9TIVJXUMYIh4KdmJqs0eujeVmQuM7TZC.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/V0pUWbrrEt2VlfmgUPwxZwy1I9BSEKG2pYjH4bkz.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/B9IJVYLur8jTiUnUK5WoNTl0Uay1EfTl61o0glvU.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/U9lQbPgF9xjCiiGatzQe9O3DEuyJ15C8DemHXD