(252, 'NISSAN 370 Z', 'nissan-370-z-1', 'Used', 'Black', 'Black', 'Nissan', 'Manual', '370 Z COUPE', 'Coupe', 'RWD', '2', 'GAS', 'BASE', '<p>The Nissan 370Z Coupe is a stylish two-door sports car with a bold design.</p><p>It is powered by a responsive 3.7-litre V6 engine that delivers strong performance.</p><p>The car offers precise handling and an engaging driving experience.</p><p>Its rear-wheel-drive layout provides excellent balance on the road.</p><p>The interior features supportive sport seats and a driver-focused cockpit.</p><p>Modern technology includes Bluetooth connectivity and available navigation.</p><p>The 370Z Coupe is known for its reliability and durable engineering.</p><p>Its sleek exterior gives it a timeless and aggressive appearance.</p><p>The vehicle is suitable for both daily driving and weekend adventures.</p><p>Overall, the Nissan 370Z Coupe is an exciting sports car that combines performance, comfort, and style.</p>', 'available', 98666, 'km', 19999, '3.7 L', '2', '[\"Traction control\",\"Navigation system\",\"Bluetooth\",\"Keyless Entry\",\"LED Headlight\",\"Bluetooth Audio\",\"21\\\" Sport Wheels\",\"Multi-Function Steering Wheel\",\"Paddle Shift\",\"Comfort Seat\",\"Blind Spot Assist\",\"Keyless Go\",\"Smart Key\",\"Power Tailgate\",\"Power Folding Mirror\",\"Active Curise Control\"]', 2017, '[\"\\/storage\\/images\\/dXYZ5eWB70pErC7KwOTr1ITI1gZjY0S7ILFyNQcI.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/2iqs73D7dbtbYsM0TqdhLVnyx9TXonwEHdN9QV42.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/NZBJIE5QpQICclmjFgTjCXeUISMnBlZykmP6Dqsm.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/S8RCckWPYRMahtNXv39tP2O6j6vHGGh8XqTPk1U0.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/IadaOGarBBuhN1CQwwuSeaU7KzWAlG8H42bD6Iom.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/00nNcLoUgFfqlXzVX2VP154wzKkfzRut0J0YYOJs.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/Vbot3ZUweIqWslIsjw00NQTwdmJvbzqqUImioHSa.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/hff51VR0tQWAiNhN7BdHxwHVWhAvyUVPChTxjIhG.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/images\\/M65XLRuXzQq8VJ8m6UxHNdITcMLMpo26YKhNeFug.jpg\",\"\\/storage\\/ima